<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha kutumbula cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha kutumbula cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli pa kutumbula chavili chitabu chivaha chechamanyikini ngati Chitabu cha Samweli. Pakutumbula chitabu chenichi chagavaniswi na kuvya hitabu hivili mu litoleo lelakemiwi Seputuaginti. Lenili lavili litoleo la kutumbula la tafusili ya Lilaganu la Kadeni kwa luga ya Chiyunani. Liina la tafusili yeniyo lavi na mana kuvya yayandikwi na vandu vasomi sabini amala sabini na vavili va Chiyawudi. Mutafusili ya Chigiliki, hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vyakemiwi 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi, na mu litoleo la Chilatini lelagelekili, hitabu yeniyo yang'anamwiki na kukemiwa 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi. Hinu hitabu yeyimanyikana lelu iyi ngati 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi vyakemiwi 3 Vankosi na 4 Vankosi. Chitabu cha 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vikokosa wumi wa mlota Samweli na nkosi Sauli na nkosi Daudi. Samweli avii chilongosi wa mwishu lukumbi mulima wa Izilaeli pewabadiliswi kuhuma kutalaliwa na vahamula na kutumbula kutalaliwa na vankosi. Samweli ndi mweavayitalili mahuta Sauli na Daudi kuvakita vavya vankosi va kutumbula va Izilaeli. Hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vidandawula histoliya ya mulima wa Isilaeli lukumbi lwenulo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawaka mundu mweamanyili yani mweayandiki chitabu cha 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli. Muyandika ajiluwili lepi mwene mu chitabu chenichi, nambu pangi avii mumi lukumbi lwoha lwa ulongosi wa nkosi Daudi, na pangi asigalili mumi hati pawapitili ulongosi wenuwo, ndi pangi yihotoleka ahotwili kugawona na kusoma mayandiku gangia gegadandawili wumi wa Sauli na Samweli. Ndava muni yimanyikana lepi mundu amala vandu vevayandiki hitabu yeniyi, mewa yimanyikana lepi hitabu yeniyi yayandikwi ndali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili mugati</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula 1-3 zikokosa kuvelekwa na kukemelewa kwa mteta Samweli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 4-7 zikokosa Vafilisiti chevatoli Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli na chelikomakesa mu milima ya Vafilisiti lukumbi pelavili kwenukwo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 8-15 zikokosa chechahumalili lukumbi Vaisilaeli pevayupili vapewa nkosi wavi, na Samweli akamyitila mahuta Sauli avya nkosi wa kutumbula na Bambu Chapanga cheamubeli Sauli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 16-31 zikokosa Samweli cheamuyitili mahuta Daudi avya nkosi wa pili wa Isilaeli na Sauli chealingili kumkoma Daudi mbaka lukumbi peafwili Sauli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana na vandu va munyumba yaki ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Kwavili na mundu mmonga mweakemiwi Elikana wa likabila la Efulaimu, mweatamayi pamuji wa Lama ku mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu. Mwene avili mwana wa Yelohamu, mjukulu wa Elihu, hukulu waki avii Tohu mweahumalili wa lukolo lwa Zufu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana avii na vadala vavili, mmonga akemiwa Hana na yungi akemiwa Penina. Penina avii na vana, nambu Hana avii lepi na vana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila mwaka Elikana agendili kuhuma ku Lama kuhamba ku Shilo ndava ya kumufugamila Bambu Chapanga mweana uhotola woha na kumuwusila teta. Kwenuko vana vavili va chigosi va Eli, Hofini na Finehasi venavo ndi vavii vamteta va Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Kila lukumbi pelahikili ligono la kuteta, Elikana amupelayi Penina mdala waki lilundu limonga la nyofu na lilundu limonga kwa kila vana vaki va chigosi na va chidala. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Nambu Elikana amupelayi Hana malundu gavili muni amuganili neju, na Bambu Chapanga amukitili akotoka kuveleka. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Kangi Penina amukitila luhonda muni amuyomesa Hana, muni Bambu Chapanga amukitili akotoka kuvelela vana. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Lijambu lenili layendalili kuhumalila chenicho mu kila mwaka. Kila lukumbi Hana peahambayi kunyumba ya Bambu Chapanga, Penina amukitila luhonda Hana mbaka Hana avembayi na abelayi kulya chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana mngana waki Hana, akamukota, “Ndava kyani uvemba? Ndava kyani uganili lepi kulya? Ndava kyani uvii mvinisu mu mtima waku? Wu, nene nambwina lepi kwaku kuliku vana kumi va chigosi?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Ligono limonga pevamalili kulya na kunywa ku Shilo, Hana akayima. Lukumbi lwenulo mteta Eli atamili pa chigoda pamuhana ya chizingiti cha mlyangu wa nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana kuni avii na mvinisu neju mu mtima, amuyupayi Bambu Chapanga kuni ivemba neju. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Hana akavika nazili kwa kujova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga mweuna makakala, unilolayi nene namuhengaji waku! ulolayi mang'aiso gangu na unikumbukayi ukotoka kunikosiwa ngati ukanipelayi mwana wa chigosi, mwana mwenuyo yati nikukuwusila veve Bambu Chapanga avyayi waku magono gaki goha ga wumi waki, katu mayunju ga mumutu waki yati giketwa lepi.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana peavili iyendelela kumuyupa Bambu Chapanga, Eli akavya akuilolokesa milomo ya Hana. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana ayupayi cha kumtima, kuni milomo yaki yakinakinayi, nambu chayuwaniki lepi cheijova. Penapo Eli aholalili kuvya Hana agalili. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Penapo Eli akamukota Hana, “Wu yati uyendelela kugala mbaka ndali? Lekayi kunywega divayi.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Nambu Hana akamuyangula, “Nigalili lepi bambu wangu, nene namudala mwenivii na mvinisu neju mu mtima wangu, nene ninywili lepi divayi wala ugimbi, nambu namujovelayi Bambu Chapanga gegavii mu mtima wangu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Kotoka kuniholalela kuvya nene namudala mbudanu. Nivi mu kuyupa penapa kuni nivii na mvinisu uvaha na ning'ahika.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Ndi Eli akamujovela, “Uhambayi kwa uteke na Chapanga wa Isilaeli akupelayi cheumuyupili.” <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana akajova, “Nikuyupa nene namuhengaji waku uholalela gabwina kunivala nene.” Kangi Hana akawuka akalya chakulya, na avili lepi na mvinisu.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ivelekewa na kubaguliwa ndava ya Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Chilau yaki lukela pehee, Elikana na vandu va mu nyumba yaki vakayimuka, vakamuyupa Bambu Chapanga, kangi vakawuya ku nyumba yavi ku Lama. Elikana akagonekana na Hana mdala waki, na Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula Hana chila cheayupayi. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Penapo Hana akavya na ndumbu, akamveleka mwana wa chigosi. Na mwene akampela liina Samweli, muni ajovili, “Namuyupili kwa Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Lukumbi Elikana pamonga na vandu va mu nyumba yaki pevahambili kuwusa teta za kutinyiswa za kila mwaka kwa Bambu Chapanga na kutimilisa nazili yaki, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana ahambili lepi, amujovili mgosi waki naha, “Mbaka mwana peileka kunyonga, ndi yati nikumpeleka kwenuko na yati nikumuwusa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na atamayi kwenuko magono ga wumi waki woha.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana mgangawaki Hana akayangula, “Kitayi cheuwona kuvya chabwina. Lindilayi mbaka peukumulekesayi mwana kunyonga. Na Bambu Chapanga akutangatilayi kutimilisa nazili yaku yeuyivikili.” Ndi Hana akasigalila panyumba mbaka peamulekisi mwana waki kunyonga.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Pelwahikili lukumbi lwa mwana mwenuyo kulekeswa kunyonga, Hana akamupeleka pamonga na ng'ombi yigosi yeyina miyaka hidatu, na dumula sita za uhembe na kahaku ka chikumba kekamemili divayi. Hana akamuleta mwana mu nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga ku Shilo, na mwana mwenuyo avii akona mdebe. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Pevamalili kuyihinja ng'ombi yigosi yila, ndi vakamupeleka mwana kwa mteta Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana akamujovela Eli, “Chondi bambu wangu, ngati cheutama mumi, nene ndi mdala yula wenayimili penapa papipi yaku kuni iyupa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Namuyupili Bambu Chapanga anipelayi mwana uyu, na mwene anipelili ngati chenamuyupili. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ndava yeniyo, nene nikumpela Bambu Chapanga mwana uyu, magono goha ga wumi waki abaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Na penapo vakamufugamila Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hana akumuyupa Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Kangi Hana akayupa na kujova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Mtima wangu usangalwiki ndava ya Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">muni Bambu Chapanga anipelili utopesa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Na nene nipatili makakala palongolo ya vamakoko vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">muni Bambu Chapanga anisangwili na kunipela luheku!”<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Kawaka mweavi mbwina na mweangabuda ngati Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kawaka hati mmonga mweavii ngati mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kawaka mweavii litalawu ngati Chapanga witu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Muleka kujikwiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">mukoto kulongela chi mahanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Muni Bambu Chapanga ndi mweamanyili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">na mwene ndi mweihamula matendu gitu goha.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Pinde za vevanamakakala hidenyiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">nambu avakangamalisa vevavii yutiyuti.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Vandu vala vevavili na chakulya chamahele kadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">hinu vihengeswa mahengu ganonopu ndava ya kupata chakulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">nambu vevavii na njala kadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">hinu vana vyakulya vyamahele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mdala ngababa hinu aveliki vana saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">nambu yula mweavii na vana vamahele, hinu asigalili mkiva.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Bambu Chapanga ikoma na kuyukisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">mwene akuvahelesa pahi ku ligodi na kuvawuyisa kavili.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Bambu Chapanga ndi mweakuvakita vangi vavyayi vangangu na vangi vavya vanavindu vyamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">vangi akuvahelesa na vangi akuvakwesa.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Akuvayinula vangangu kuhuma mu ungangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na vangali chindu kuhuma mu ungangu wavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Akuvatamika pamonga na vakulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na kuvakita vahala chigoda cha utopesa cha unkosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">muni mikingisa ya mulima ndi ya Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">mwene auyimiki mulima panani ya mikingisa yeniyo.”<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Mwene ndi mweakuziyunga njila za vandu vaki vevavi vasadikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">nambu yati akuvakita vandu vabudanu vakomakeswa mu chitita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Muni kawaka mundu mweipata vindu kwa makakala gaki mwene.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Vala vamakoko va Bambu yati videnywa hipandihipandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">yati ibulumila ngati mbamba kuhuma kunani ndava yavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Bambu yati akuuhamula mulima woha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">yati akumpela makakala na utopesa nkosi waki mweamuhagwili.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Kangi Elikana akawuya ku nyumba yaki ku Lama, nambu Samweli mwana waki akasigalila ku Shilo, akumuhengela Bambu palongolo ya mteta Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vagosi va Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Vana va chigosi va Eli vavii vahakau neju. Vammanyili lepi Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Hinu lwavi luhumu lwa vamteta pamonga na vandu kuvya kila lukumbi mundu peipeleka teta na kuni nofu yivila, mtumisi wa mteta ngaabwelili na chihomelu chechina ng'onji hidatu. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />na mwene ayingisayi chihomelu chenicho kwa makakala mu liteleku, nyofu yoyoha yeyahomiwi na chihomelu chenicho ndi yavya ya mteta. Chenicho ndi vamteta chevavakitili Vaisilaeli voha pevahambayi kuwusa teta ku Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Nambu kwakona hati mahuta gangayochwa, muhengaji wa mteta ngeabwelili na kumujovela mundu mweiwusa teta ya kutinyiswa, “Mpela mteta nyofu ya akayanikila pa moto, muni mwene itola lepi nyofu yeyiviliswi kuhuma kwaku, nambu itola yivisi.” <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Ngati mundu mwenuyo akamjovelayi, “Lindilayi hoti niyocha mahuta ndi utolayi chewigana,” Penapo muhengaji mwenuyo amuyangulayi, “Pehe, unipelayi hinu naha. Ngati ukunipela lepi ndi yati nitola cha makakala.” <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Kubudila kwenuko kwevakitili vana va Eli ndi kwavii kuvaha neju palongolo ya Bambu. Muni vasongolo venavo vazivevisi teta zezawusiwi kwa Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Nambu Samweli ayendalili kumuhengela Bambu Chapanga kuni awalili chizibau chamsopi. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Mu kila mwaka nyina waki amutotelayi kanzu yidebe, na amupelekelayi pevahambayi na mngana waki kuwusa teta ya kutinyiswa ya mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli akammotisa Elikana na mdala waki akajova, “Bambu Chapanga akuwuyasila veve Elikana vana vangi kwa mudala mwenuyu muni vatolayi pandu pa msongolo mwenuyu mweabaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga.” Pegamaliki genago vakakiliwuka ku nyumba yavi. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Bambu Chapanga amkitili gabwina Hana, ndi akaveleka vana vagosi vadatu na vana vadala vavili. Lukumbi lulwolwo msongolo Samweli ayendelela kukula na kuyendelela kumuhengela Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na vana vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Lukumbi lwenulo Eli avii mgogolo neju. Ayuwini mambu goha gevahengayi vana vaki va chigosi kwa vandu voha va Isilaeli, na chevagonekanayi na vadala vevahengayi lihengu mu lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Penapo akavakota vana vaki, “Ndava kyani mukita mambu ngati aga? Niyuwana kuhuma kwa vandu voha gahakahu gemwikita. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Mukotoka kukita chenicho mwavana vangu! Muni mambu geniyuwana kuhuma kwa vandu va Bambu Chapanga ndi gahakau. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Ngati mundu amubudili muyaki, Bambu Chapanga ihotola kumtetela mundu mwenuyo. Nambu mundu akamubudilayi Bambu Chapanga ndi yani mweihotolayi kumuyupila kwa Bambu Chapanga muni alekekeswayi?” Nambu vana venavo vamuyuwanili lepi dadi wavi, muni Bambu Chapanga amali kuhamula kuvakoma. <verse eid="1SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Msongolo Samweli akayendelela kukula, kuni akumanisa Bambu Chapanga pamonga na vandu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga akuubela umteta wa vandu va mu nyumba ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Ligono limonga mlota wa Bambu Chapanga akamuhambila Eli, akamujovela, “Bambu Chapanga ijova naha, ‘Najigubukwili kwa vandu va mu nyumba ya Haluni dadi waku peavili ku uvanda kwa Falao ku mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Pagati ya makabila goha ga Isilaeli namuhagwili Haluni na vandu vaki voha vavyayi vamteta vangu, vanihengelayi na vawusa teta za kutinyiswa pandu pa kuwusila teta, vahukisayi ubani na vawalayi chizibau kuni vakunihengela. Vandu va mu nyumba ya dadi waku Haluni vapewa pandu pa teta zangu za kutinyiswa zevaniwusili vandu va Isilaeli kwa motu. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ndava kyani, ukuzimilila mata teta za kutinyiswa na teta zenavalagizi vandu vaniletelayi? Veve uvayuwanili vana vaku kuliku nene kwa kujikulupalisa mwavene kwa kulya pandu pabwina pa teta zevakuniwusila vandu vangu va Isilaeli!’ <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ijova naha, ‘Najovili kuvya vandu va munyumba yaku na vandu va munyumba ya vagogo vaku yati mwibwela palongolo yangu kunihengela magono goha gangali mwisu,’ Nambu hinu Bambu Chapanga ijova kuvya yati nikita lepi chenicho kangi, yati nikuvatopesa vala vevakunitopesa na vala vevakunivevesa yati nikuvavevesa. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Lola magono gibwela genikuvakoma vasongolo va mu vandu va mu nyumba yaku na mu lukolo lwaku, penapo yati kwivya lepi na mgosi yoyoha mweisigalila mumi mbaka muugogolo waki. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Vandu va mu nyumba yaku yati ving'ahika pevivya mu nyumba yangu, pamonga kuvya Vaisilaeli yati vimotisiwa, kawaka mundu mweitama muni mbaka kuvya mgogolo mu lukolo lwaku. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Yoyoha mwenikumleka mumi yati ilekwa ndava ya kuvemba na kuuvinisa mtima waki, na vagosi vamahele muuveleku waku yati vifwa vakona vangavya vagogolo. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Na chila chechikuvakolela vana vaku vavili, Hofini na Finehasi ndi voha vavili yati vifwa ligono limonga na lijambu lenilo ndi yati livya ulangisu. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Kangi yati nikumuhagula mteta yungi msadikika mweikita gala ga mumtima wangu na genikugaholalela. Mwene yati nikumpela uveleku weukangamili, na vene magono goha yati vakumuhengela nkosi mwenikumuhagula. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Mundu yoyoha mweisigalilayi mu vandu va munyumba yaku yati akumuhambila mteta mwenuyo na kumgundamila na kumuyupa mashonga amala chipandi cha libumunda, na kumujovela, ‘Chondi niyupa nipela lihengu nunuyu mu uteta muni nihotola kupata chakulya.’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Bambu Chapanga akumuhumila Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo msongolo Samweli avii akumuhengela Bambu Chapanga kuni iyimamiwa Eli. Na mwene Bambu Chapanga alongili na vandu hotohoto mala zidebe, na avalotisi lepi ndoto lukumbi lwoha. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Kilu yimonga Eli mweavii na mihu gegatubwili kubela kulola bwina avii agonili mu chumba chaki. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Samweli mewa avii agonili munyumba ya Bambu Chapanga papipi na Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Chapanga. Na hai ya Bambu Chapanga yavili yakona yiyaka. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamukemela Samweli! Na mwene Samweli akayidika “Nene apa.” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Kangi Samweli akajumba na kumuhambila mteta Eli akamujovela, “Nibwelili muni veve unikemili.” Nambu Eli akamujovela, “Nene nikukemili lepi, hamba ukagonayi.” Samweli akahamba kugona kavili. <verse eid="1SA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Bambu Chapanga akamukemela kavili Samweli, “Samweli!” Samweli akayimuka akamuhambila kavili Eli na kumujovela, “Nibwelili muni ndava unikemili.” Nambu Eli akamujovela, “Wamwana wangu nikukemili lepi, hamba kagona kavili.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli avii akona angamumanya Bambu Chapanga, na Linenu la Bambu Chapanga lavii lakona langagubukuliwa kwaki. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Bambu Chapanga akamukemela Samweli kwa mala ya datu. Samweli akayimuka, na akamuhambila Eli akamujovela, “Nibwelili ndava ukanikemili.” Penapo Eli akamanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga ndi mweakumukemela Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ndi Eli akamujovela Samweli, “Hamba kagona na akakukemelayi kavili mujovelayi naha, ‘Jova veve Bambu Chapanga muni nene mtumisi waku nikuyuwanila.’” Ndi Samweli akakiliwuka kugona pandu paki. <verse eid="1SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Bambu Chapanga akabwela akayima papipi nayu na akamukemela ngati cheamukemili pakutumbula, “Samweli! Samweli!” Samweli akayangula, “Jova, ndava muni nene mtumisi waku nikuyuwanila!” <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Samweli, “Yuwanila nivii papipi kukita lijambu nunuyu pa mulima wa Isilaeli na mundu yoyoha mweiyuwanayi yati ivya na wogohi. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Ligono lenilo yati nikumkitila Eli pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki mambu gala goha genajovili yati nikumkitila tangia pakutumbula mbaka pamwisu. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Namujovili kuvya yati nikuvabuna vandu va munyumba yaki magono goha gangali ni mwisu, ndava ya kumbudila kwavi Chapanga kweakumanyili muni vana vaki va chigosi vaniligili nene, na mwene avalakalili lepi. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ndava yeniyo nilapa kuvala vandu va mu nyumba ya Eli kuvya kubuda kwavi yati kuwusiwa lepi kwa teta ya kuhinjwa amala kwa teta.” <verse eid="1SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli akagona penapala mbaka lukela, akayimuka na kudindula milyangu ga nyumba ya Bambu Chapanga. Nambu ayogwipi kumujovela Eli gala geajovili Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Nambu Eli akamukemela, “Msongolo wangu Samweli!” Samweli akayangula, “Nene apa.” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli akamukota, “Wu, Bambu Chapanga akakujovili kyani? Kotoka kunihiha cheakujovili, ngati ukanihiha Chapanga akubuna neju.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ndi, Samweli akamujovela Eli goha geajoviwi, amuhihili lepi chindu chochoha. Eli akajova, “Mwene ndi Bambu Chapanga muleka ahenga chochoha cheiwona kuvya chabwina kwaki.” <verse eid="1SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Bambu Chapanga avii pamonga na Samweli peakulayi, na gala goha geajovili kawaka hati limonga lealileki kukita. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Vandu voha va pamulima wa Isilaeli tangia ku Dani, upandi wa kasikazini, mbaka Beeli Sheba kuupandi wa kusini, vakamanya kuvya Samweli avii mlota wa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Bambu Chapanga akayendelela kujilangisa uko ku Shilo kweamuhumalili Samweli kwa ndila ya linenu laki.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Vafilisti vakulitola Lisanduku La Lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Kangi Samweli avajovili vandu voha va Isilaeli ujumbi weapewi na Bambu Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Lukumbi lwenulo Vafilisti vakakonganeka pamonga, ndava ya kutovana na Vaisilaeli. Vaisilaeli vakavika kambi yavi ku Ebenezeli, Vafilisti na vene vakavika kambi yavi ku Afeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Vafilisti vakavahambila Vaisilaeli na kuvazangila, na pevatovini neju Vaisilaeli vatoviwi na kukomiwa elufu mcheche ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Manjolinjoli vevasumukini pevakiliwiki pa kambi, vachilongosi va Vaisilaeli vakavakota, “Ndava kyani lelu Bambu Chapanga avalekili Vafilisti vatihotolayi? Tihambayi ku Shilo tikalitolayi Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, muni Bambu Chapanga avya pamonga na tete na kutisangula kuhuma kwa vamakoko vitu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ndi vakavatuma vandu ku Shilo na venavo vakalileta Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga mweanamakakala goha, mweavi na chigoda chaki cha unkosi pagati ya viumbi vivili vyevivi na magwaba vyevikemiwa makelubi. Na vana vavili vagosi va mteta Eli, Ofini na Fineasi vakabwela pamonga na Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Lukumbi Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga pelahikili pa kambi, Vaisilaeli voha vakaluluta kwa sangaluka, mbaka mulima ukanyugusika. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Vafilisti pevayuwini Vaebulania viluluta ndi vakakotana, “Kululuta kwenuko ku kambi ya Vaebulania ndi mana yaki kyani?” Pevamanyili kuvya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga liletiwi ku kambi ya Vaebulania, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Vafilisiti vakayogopa na vakajova, yihotoleka michapanga hivabwelili pa kambi yavi! Penapo vakajova, “Talachikolela ndava muni chindu ngati chenichi chiwahili lepi kuhumalila kwakona. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Talachikolela yani mweihotola kutisangula kuhuma mu michapanga yeniyo yeyina makaka? Yeniyo ndi michapanga yeyavakomili Vamisili ku lukongolo mumatovelu ndalindali. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Hinu nyenye mwa Vafilisiti muvya ngangali, mutovana ngondo ngati manjolinjoli vevavii na makakala, mwalavya mwavavanda va Vaebulania ngati vene chevavili vavanda vitu. Mtovana navu ngati manjolinjoli vevavii na umanya.” <verse eid="1SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Vafilisti vakatovana na Vaisilaeli kwa ukekesi na Vaisilaeli vakabuniwa na kila mundu akatilalila ku nyumba yaki. Mu ligono lenilo vakomiwi manjolinjoli va Isilaeli vevigenda kwa magendelu elufu selasini. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga latoliwi na Vafilisiti, na vala vana vagosi vavili va Eli, Hofini na Finehasi vakomiwi.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Ligono lilolo mundu mmonga wa likabila la Benjamini ajumbili kuhuma ku ngondo na akahika ku Shilo, kuni apapwili nyula zaki na ajiyitili lububu ku mutu waki. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Mundu yula peahikili amuweni Eli atamili pa chigoda chaki pamuhana ya njila kuni ilola ngati kuna mundu yoyoha mweibwela kuhuma ku ngondo, muni mtima waki wavii na wogohi ndava ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. Mundu yula peayingili pabomani na kukokosa goha gegahumalili, vandu voha vakavemba kwa lwami luvaha. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli peayuwini vandu vivemba ndi akakota, “Vandu ava vivembela kiki?” Mundu yula akajumba akahamba kwa Eli na kumujovela mambu genago. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Lukumi lwenulo Eli avili na miyaka tisini na nane na mihu gaki galolayi lepi bwina. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Mundu yula akamujovela Eli, “Nene nihumili ku ngondo hinu naha, na nitilili kuhuma ku ngondo lelu yiyiyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli akamukota, “Wamwana wangu, chihumalili kyani kwenuko?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Mundu yula mwealetili ujumbi akamuyangula, “Vaisilaeli vatoviwi na kuvatila Vafilisiti, na manjolinjoli vamahele va Isilaeli vakomiwi. Pamonga na genago, vana vaku vavili Hofini na Finehasi, vakomiwi, na Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga valitolili Vafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Mundu mwenuyo pealuwili ndu Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, Eli akagwa njanja kuhuma pa chigoda chaki pamuhana ya mulyangu. Cheagwili chenicho Eli akadenyeka singu yaki muni avii mgogolo na avii akulupalili, ni mwene akafwa. Eli avii avalongwisi Vaisilaeli kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala wa Finehasi ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Lukumbi mambu genago gihumalila, mdala wa Finehasi, mukamwana wa Eli, avii na ndumbu na lukumbi lwaki lwa kuveleka lwahegalili. Peayuwini kuvya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga litoliwi na kuvya mngana waki pamonga na mkohanu waki vafwili, bahopo akavya na lipyanda na akaveleka mwana. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Mdala mwenuyo peafwayi, vadala vevamutangatilayi vakamujovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa, muni uveliki mwana mgosi.” Nambu mwene avayangwili lepi chochoha, wala avayuwanili lepi. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Mwana mwenuyo akamukemela Ikabodi, mana yaki, “Ukulu wa Chapanga uwukili pa Isilaeli.” Ndava muni Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga latoliwi na mngana waki pamonga na mkohanu waki vafwili. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ajovili chenicho muni, ukulu wa Bambu Chapanga uwukili pa Isilaeli ndava Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga litoliwi na Vafilisiti.<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lilaganu pagati ya Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Vafilisiti pevamalili kulitola Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, vakaligega kuhuma ku muji wa Ebenezeli mbaka ku muji wavi wa Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Ndi vakalipeleka Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga mugati ya nyumba ya Dagoni mchapanga wavi na kulivika pamuhana ya chimong'omong'o cha mchapanga wavi weukemiwa Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Chilau yaki lukela, vandu va muji wa Ashidodi pevayimwiki vakawona chimong'omong'o cha Dagoni chigwili cha kukupama palongolo ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. Vakachiyimika kavili chimong'omong'o cha Dagoni na kuchivika kavili pahali paki. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Nambu, chilau yaki lukela pevayimwiki, vakawona chimong'omong'o cha Dagoni chigwili cha kukupama palongolo ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, chidenyiki mutu na magendelu na mawoko vyoha vyenivyo vyadenyiki vikavya vigonili paha ya felemu lwa mulyangu. Chechasigalili ndi higa ndu ya chimong'omong'o cha Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Ndima na vamteta va Dagoni na vandu voha peviyingila mu nyumba ya mchapanga wavi Dagoni ku Ashidodi, vilivatila lepi lufelemu lwa pamulyangu wa kuyingalila mbaka lelu.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Bambu Chapanga akavabuna neju vandu va ku Ashidodi na vala vevitama mu vijiji vyevivi papipi navu, akavaletela uhalabisu na kuvang'aha kwa maputi. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Vandu va pa Ashidodi pevagaweni mambu gegakuvakolela, ndi vakajova, “Chapanga wa Isilaeli akutibuna neju tete pamonga na mchapanga witu Dagoni. Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga liganikiwa lepi livya kwitu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ndi vakavatuma vandu kuvakemela vachilongosi voha va Vafilisiti na vakavakota, “Wu, tilikita wuli Lisanduku lenili la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Vachilongosi vala vakayangula, “Lisanduku lenili la Lilanganu la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli tilipelekayi ku Gati.” Ndi vakalipeleka ku muji wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Nambu pevamali kulipeleka Lisanduku lenilo ku muji wa Gati, penapo Bambu Chapanga akavabuna vandu va muji wa Gati vavaha kwa vadebe kuvakita vamyogopayi neju kwa kuvaletela maputi. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ndi vakalipeleka Lisanduku lenilo la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga mbaka ku Ekiloni. Nambu pavalihikisi kwenuko Lisanduku lenilo la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli, vandu va muji wenuwo vakavembeneka na kujova, “Vatiletili Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli ndava ya kutikomakesa tete na vandu vitu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ndi vakavakemela vachilongosi voha va Vafilisiti na kuvajovela, “Muliwuyisayi Lisanduka la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli mu mulima wavi, ngati lepi yati likutikoma tete pamonga na vandu vitu.” Vakakita chenicho ndava muni Bambu Chapanga avabunayi neju na vandu vamahele vamali kufwa, hinu vandu vavi na wogohi. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Na vala vevavii vakona mumi vavii na maputi, na chivembu chavi chikahika mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Vafilisiti valiwuyisa Lisanduku La Lilaganu ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga pelatamili pa mulima wa Vafilisiti mulukumbi lwa miehi saba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Vafilisiti vakavakemela vamteta vavi va Dagoni pamonga na valondola vavi na kuvakota, “Wu, tikita wuli kulivala Lisanduku lenili la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga? Mutijovelayi tihotola wuli kuliwuyisa ku Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Vene vakavayangula, “Pemukiliwusa Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli, mukotoka kukiliwusa mawoko gawaka. Kwa namuna yoyoha yila, muwusayi na teta ya kuwusa mabudilu, na nyenye yati mwilama. Mukakitayi chenicho yati mwimanya ndava ya kyani Chapanga avya akuvabuna.” <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Vafilisiti vakakota, “Timupelekela teta yoki ya kuwusa kubuda?” Vene vakavayangula, “Mupeleka vimong'omong'o muhanu vya zahabu vyeviwanangana na maputi na mupelekayi pamonga na vimong'omong'o muhanu vya zahabu vyeviwanangana na magudwani, kila chimong'omong'o chiyima pahala pa nkosi mmonga wa Vafilisiti, ndava muni utamu wewavapatili nyenye ndi wuwowo wewavapatili vankosi vinu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mutendekehayi luhumu lwa himong'omong'o hya maputi na himong'omong'o ya magudwani, vindu vyevikita vandu vinu vakomakeswa. Yiganikiwa mumupela utopesa Chapanga wa Vaisilaeli. Pangi yati ileka kuvabuna nyenye pamonga na michapanga yinu na mulima winu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ndava ya kyani muvya na chinywinda mu mitima yinu ngati chevakitili va Misili na nkosi wavi Falao? Wu, Chapanga peavang'ahisi Vamisili, vavalekili lepi Vaisilaeli vawukayi na vene vakawuka? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Hinu mutendekeha mutuka yamupya ya kuhutwa pamonga na ng'ombi zivili zezinyongesa zezakona kukungwa lingolingoli, muzikunga mu mutuka yeniyo nambu mipapakasi yaki mukotoka kuhamba nazu, muhileka mu chivaya. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Mutola Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga mulivika mu mutuka yeniyo, pamuhana ya Lisanduku lenilo muvikayi vimong'omong'o vya zahabu vyemukumpelekela vivya teta ya kuwusa kubudu kwinu. Kangi muyileka yihamba yene kwokwoha kweyigana kuhamba. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Muiyangalila bwina mutuka yeniyo, ngati yilongosa kuhamba ku mulima waki ku muji wa Beti Shemeshi, penapo ndi yati timanya kuvya mweatiletili msolo uwu ndi Chapanga wa Vaisilaeli. Nambu ngati yihamba lepi kwenuko, ndi yati timanya kuvya msolo uwu atiletili lepi Bambu Chapanga, nambu uhumalili wene ndu.” <verse eid="1SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Vakakita ngati chevajoviwi, vakazitola ng'ombi zivili zezinyongesa na kuzikunga zihuta mutuka yeniyo, na mipapakasi yavi vakahikunga mu chivaya. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga lila vakalivika mu mutuka pamonga na libokisi lelina himong'omong'o ya magudwani ga zahabu na himong'omong'o yeyiwanangana na maputi. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Kangi ng'ombi zenizo zikalongosa kuhamba ku muji wa Beti Shemeshi changali kuvedukila kumangiha amala kuupandi wa kulyelela, na pezahambayi zapita kuvemba. Vankosi muhanu va Vafilisiti vala ndi vakazilandalila mbaka ku mubaka wa Beti Shemeshi. <verse eid="1SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Vandu va ku Beti Shemeshi vabenayi nganu ku liwasi. Pevayinwili mitu yavi na kuliwona Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, na vene vakahekelela neju. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Mutuka yeniyo yikahika ku mgunda wa Yoshua, mundu wa ku Beti Shemeshi, yikayima pamuhana ya liganga livaha. Vandu vakayibomolana mutuka yila, na ng'ombi zila vakamuwusila Bambu Chapanga luteta lwa kutinyisa. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Valawi vakalihelesa Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga pamonga na libokisi lila lelina himong'omong'o ya zahabu na kuvika panani ya liganga livaha. Kangi vandu va Beti Shemeshi vakamuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta za kutinyiswa kwa motu na teta zingi. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Vachilongosi muhanu va Vafilisiti vala pevamali kugawona gegahengiki penapo, ligono lilolo vakakiliwuka ku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Chenichi ndi Vafilisiti chevapeliki himong'omong'o ya zahabu ya maputi kwa Chapanga hivya teta ya kuwusa kubuda kwavi, chimong'omong'o chimonga chivya pahala pa muji umonga, Chimong'omong'o chimonga ndava ya muji wa Ashidodi na Chimong'omong'o chimonga ndava ya muji wa Gaza na Chimong'omong'o chimonga ndava ya muji wa Ashikeloni na Chimong'omong'o chimonga ndava ya muji wa Gati na Chimong'omong'o chimonga ndava ya muji wa Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Mewa vapeliki na himong'omong'o muhanu ya zahabu ya magudwani kulandana na muvalangu wa miji yoha ya Vafilisiti yeyatalaliwi na vakulu muhanu va Vafilisiti, miji yeniyo yatindisiwi luwumba pamonga na hijiji yaki yatindisiwi lepi luwumba. Liganga livaha lelavili mumugunda wa Yoshua mundu wa ku Beti Shemeshi livii mbaka lelu ngati ukumbuso wa pandu pelavikiwi Lisandu la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Bambu Chapanga akavakoma vandu sabini vevatama pa muji wa Beti Shemeshi, ndava valingulili mugati ya Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga. Vandu vakavya vavembeniki muni Bambu Chapanga avabunili neju.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga ku Kiliati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Kangi vandu vapa Beti Shemeshi vakajova, “Yani mweihotola kulama palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga mweiyidakiliwa kufugamiwa? Yati tikulupeleka kwa yani ndava awuka kwitu?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ndi vakavatuma vandu vahamba kwa vakolonjinji va muji wa Kiliati Yealimu vakajova, “Vafilisiti vakiliwisi Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, hinu mubwela mulitolayi.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Penapo vandu va ku Kiliati Yealimu vakahamba kulitola Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, vakalipeleka ku nyumba ya Abinadabu, yeyavi ku chitumbi. Na vakamkita Eleazali mwana waki mgosi ayidakiliwa mukumfugamila Bambu Chapanga, muni aliyungayi Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ivya chilongosi wa Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga latamili ku Kiliati Yealimu kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka ishilini, na lukumbi lwenulo lwoha Vaisilaeli voha ngolongondi mu mtima na vamuyupili neju Bambu Chapanga muni avatangatila. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samweli akavajovela Vaisilaeli, “Ngati mukumuwuyila Bambu Chapanga kwa mitima yinu yoha, muganikiwa muiwusayi michapanga ya chiyehe yeyivii pagati yinu na vimong'omong'o vya Ashitaloti. Mumuhambilayi Bambu Chapanga kwa mitima yinu yoha, na kumuhengela mwene ndu, ndi na mwene yati akuvasangula mumawoko ga Vafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Penapo Vaisilaeli vakahitaga kutali himong'omong'o ya Vabahali na Vaashitaloti, ndi vakamuhengela Bambu Chapanga mwene ndu. <verse eid="1SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Kangi Samweli akavajovela vachilongosi voha va Vaisilaeli, “Muvakemela Vaisilaeli voha vakonganeka ku Mizipa, na kwenuko nene yati nikuvayupila kwa Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ndi Vaisilaeli voha vakakonganeka ku Mizipa. Vakanega manji na kugayita palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kulangisa kuvya vavii mu mang'aisu na ligono lenilo loha vakajihinisa changali kulya na vakajova, “Timuhokili Bambu Chapanga witu.” Samweli ndi avii muhamula wa Vaisilaeli ku Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Vafilisiti pevayuwini kuvya Vaisilaeli vakonganiki pamonga ku Mizipa, vachilongosi muhanu va Vafilisiti vakahamba kuvahanganila. Vaisilaeli pevayuwini lijambu lenilo, vakavya na wogohi ndava ya Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Hinu Vaisilaeli vakamujovela Samweli, “Kotokayi kuleka kutiyupila kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu muni atisangula kwa Vafilisiti venavo.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Penapo Samweli akatola mwana limbelele mweakona inyonga, akamuwusila Bambu Chapanga kuvya teta ya kutinyiswa, kangi Samweli akamyupa Bambu Chapanga ndava ya Vaisilaeli, na mwene Bambu Chapanga akayangula kuyupa kwaki. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Lukumbi Samweli peawusayi teta ya kutinyiswa yila, Vafilisiti vavii papipi kuvahanganila Vaisilaeli. Nambu Bambu Chapanga akavayogopesa Vafilisiti kwa lwami luvaha lwa mbamba kuhuma kunani kwaki na vene vakawehuka na vahotwili lepi kutovana na Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Vaisilaeli vakavajumbisa Vafilisiti kuhuma ku Mizipa na kuvakoma mu njila mbaka papipi na muji weukemiwa Beti Kali. <verse eid="1SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Ndi Samweli akalitola liganga na kuliyimika pagati ya Mizipa na Sheni, liganga lenilo akalikemela Ebenezeli akajova, “Mbaka penapa petivili Bambu Chapanga atitangatili.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Kwa namuna yeniyo Vafilisiti vatoviwi ku ngondo na vawuyalili lepi kavili kuyizangila Isilaeli. Lukumbi lwoha Samweli peavi mumi, Bambu Chapanga atumili uhotola waki kutovana na Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Miji yoha ya Vaisilaeli yeyatoliwi na Vafilisiti kuhuma ku Ekiloni mbaka ku Gati ikawuyiswa kwa Vaisilaeli, na vene vakaugombola mulima wavi kuhuma kwa Vafilisiti. Hinu kukavya na uteke pagati ya Vaisilaeli na Vaamoli. <verse eid="1SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samweli ayendalili kuvya muhamula wa Vaisilaeli mu wumi waki woha. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Mu kila mwaka Samweli agendalelayi ku Beteli na ku Giligali na ku Mizipa, na kuhamula mihalu Vaisilaeli vevatamayi mu miji yeniyo yoha. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Peamalayi akiliwukayi ku Lama, muni kwenuko kwavili ku nyumba yaki, kwenuko mewa avahamulayi Vaisilaeli, na mwene kwenuko akamujengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pa kuwusila teta.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli viyupa vavyayi na nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samweli peavili mgogolo, ndi akavakita vana vaki va chigosi vavyayi vahamula va pa mulima wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwana waki wa kutumbula wa chigosi ndi akemiwayi Yoeli, na wa chigosi mwealandili akemiwayi Abiya. Voha vavili vavii vahamula ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Nambu vana venavo vatamili lepi cha kumganisa Bambu Chapanga ngati cheakitili dadi wavi, nambu vajilondelayi chiyonjokesu chavi vene, vapokela hongo na vakalihamula lepi cha uchakaka.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ndi vachilongosi voha va Vaisilaeli vakakonganeka pamonga na kumuhambila Samweli ku muji wa Lama, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />vakamujovela, “Hinu veve wamugogolo na vana vaku vikita lepi gakumganisa Chapanga ngati chaukita veve. Hinu utihagulilayi nkosi wa kutilongosa ngati chevikita ku milima yingi yoha.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Nambu vene pevajovili, “Tipela nkosi wa kutilongosa.” Lijambu lenilo lamganisi lepi Samweli, na mwene akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Samweli, “Vayuwanilayi kila chindu chevakujovela vandu, muni vakubelili lepi veve, nambu vanibelili nene nikoto kuvya nkosi wavi. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Tangiya penavawusili ku Misili, vanilekili nene, vakuyihengela michapanga yingi mbaka lelu. Hinu mambu gevanikitili nene ndi gagogo gevakukitila na veve. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Hinu veve vayuwanila nambu uvalakalila neju na uvajovela hotohoto mambu geakuvakitila nkosi mweakuvatalalilayi.” <verse eid="1SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Penapo Samweli akavajovela vandu vevayupayi vapewa nkosi, malovi goha geajoviwi na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Akavajovela, “Chenichi ndi cheakuvakitila nkosi winu mweibwela kuvatalalila. Yati akuvatola vana vinu va chigosi vavya vandu va kugendesa mutuka zaki za ngondo na vangi yati vivya vakwela falasi, na vangi yati vijumba palongolo ya mutuka zaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Yati akujihagulila vangi vavyayi vakekesi va kulongosa msambi wa manjolinjoli elufu yimonga va ngondo na vangi vavyayi vakekesi va kuvalongosa msambi wa manjolinjoli hamusini. Na vangi yati vakumlimila migunda yaki na kubena mabenu gaki, na vangi yati akuvakita vavya vatengenezaji va vindu vyaki vya ngondo, na vangi yati vivya va kukita lufumbu lwa vyuma vya mutuka zaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Yati akuvatola vasikana vinu na kuvakita vamutengenezelayi mahuta geginungalila, na vangi yati vivya va kutelaka na vangi vivya va kuteleka mabumunda. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Yati itola migunda hinu yabwina, na migunda ya mizabibu na migunda ya mizeituni na kuvapela vahengaji vaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Yati itola pandu pa lilundu la kumi pa mabenu ginu na pa mizabibu yinu na kuvapela vakulu vevavii pahi yaki na vahengaji vaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Yati akuvatola vahengaji vinu va chigosi na va chidala na ng'ombi zinu zezikulupi na punda zinu ndava ya kuhengela mwene. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Yati itola pandu pa kumi mu misambi ya mene na mambelele ginu. Na nyenye mwavene yati mwivya mwavavanda vaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Pegakuvakolela genago, nyenye yati mwivemba kugana utangatila ndava ya nkosi mwemujihagulili mwavene, nambu Bambu Chapanga yati akuvayangula lepi.” <verse eid="1SA 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Nambu vandu vakabela kumuyuwanila Samweli, vakajova, “Lepi, tete tigana tivyayi na nkosi mweakutitalalila, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />muni na tete tivyayi ngati vandu va milima hingi. Nkosi witu yati akutihamula mu mihalu yitu na kutilongosa ku ngondo.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Ndi Samweli akahamba kumjovela Bambu Chapanga malovi goha geajoviwi na vandu. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Samweli, “Vayuwanilayi na uvahagulila nkosi.” Kangi Samweli akavajovela, “Kila mundu awuya ku muji waki.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ikonganeka na Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Mulikabila la Benjamini, avii mundu mmonga mweanavindu vyamahele mweimanyikana, mundu mwenuyo liina laki akemiwi Kishi, mwana wa Abieli, na mjukulu wa Zelo na chitengula cha Bekolati dadi waki akemiwi Afia mweahumalili mu likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kishi avili na mwana wa chigosi mweikemiwa Sauli, Sauli avii msongolo mweanyambili, na kawaka mundu pa Isilaeli mweanyambili ngati Sauli. Sauli avii mtali neju kuliku vandu voha va pa mulima wa Isilaeli, vandu voha vamuhikilayi mumavega. <verse eid="1SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Ligono limonga mapunda ga Kishi dadi waki Sauli gayagili, na mwene Kishi akamujovela mwana waki Sauli, “Umutolayi muhengaji mmonga uhamba nayu kugalonda mapunda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Na vene vakahamba kulonda, vakapita mu mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu na pandu poha pa Shalisha, nambu kwenuko vagapatili lepi. Kangi vakahamba mbaka ku mulima wa Shaalimu na kwenuko mewa vagapati lepi. Vakapita mbaka ku mulima wa Benjamini nambu na kwenuko mewa vagapati lepi. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Pevahikili pa mulima wa Zufu, Sauli akamujovela muhengaji waki, “Tikiliwukayi ku nyumba, ndava ngati tangakiliwuka, dadi wangu yati ileka kuholalela mapunda, na yati itumbula kutihololela tete.” <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Mtumisi yula akayangula, “Lindila hoti, pa muji uwu avii mundu wa Chapanga, mweitopeswa na vandu voha muni vyoha vyeilongela vimwangila hotohoto. Hinu timuhambilayi pangi ihotola kutijovela tihamba upandi woki.” <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli akamkota mtumisi waki, “Hinu tikamuhambilayi mundu mwenuyo yati tikumpela kyani? Ndava vyakulya vya mu lugendu vyetabweli navyu vimaliki na tivi lepi na njombi ya kumupela mundu mwenuyo wa Chapanga. Wu tivi na njombi yoyoha ya kumpela?” <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Mtumisi yula akamuyangula Sauli, akajova, “Lola, nene nivii na chipandi chidebe cha madini ga feza. Yati nikumupela mundu mwenuyo muni ahotola kutijovela tihamba njila yoki.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Kadeni pa Isilaeli yavii mundu akaganayi kukota chindu kwa Chapanga, ngaajovi, “Bwela tihamba kwa mweilola,” Muni mulota wa hinu, kadeni vamukemelayi mweilola. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli akamuyangula, “Chabwina, hinu tihamba.” Penapo vakahamba ku muji pandu peatamayi mundu mwenuyo wa Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Pevakwelayi chitumbi kuhamba kubomani, vakakonganeka na vasikana vihamba kunega manji. Vakavakota vasikana venavo, “Wu, mundu mweilola gala geilola Chapanga avii pa muji uwu?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Vasikana vala vakavayangula, “Ena, avili. Avili palongolo yinu, mukayumbatikayi yati mukumukolela. Abwelili lelu pa muji uwu, muni lelu vandu vihamba kuteta ku pandu pa kuwusila teta pepavi ku chitumbi. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Mukayingilayi ndu pa muji yati mukumkolela akona angahamba ku chitumbi kulya. Muni vandu yati vitumbula lepi kulya mbaka mwene abwela hoti na kuyupa ndava ya chakulya. Akakitayi chenicho ndi vevagongoliwi yati vilya. Hinu muhamba kanyata yati mkonganeka nayu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ndi Sauli na mtumisi waki vakakwela kuhamba ku muji ula. Pevayingilayi mu muji, vakamuwona Samweli iwuka pa muji wenuwo, ibwela pevavili kuhambila pandu pa kunani pa kuwusila teta za kutinyiswa. <verse eid="1SA 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Jana yaki kwakona Sauli angabwela, Bambu Chapanga amali kummanyisa Samweli lijambu lenili, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />kuvya, “Chilau lukumbi ngati ulu yati nikukuletela mundu kuhuma ku mulima wa likabila la Benjamini, na veve yati ukumunyala mahuta avyayi chilongosi wa vandu vangu va Isilaeli. Mwenuyo yati akuvasangula vandu vangu kuhuma mu utalalila wa vafilisiti, muni nigaweni mang'aiso gavi na chivembu chavi chinihikili.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samweli peamuweni Sauli, Bambu Chapanga akamujovela, “Mwenuyu ndi mundu yula mwenakujovili, mwene ndi mweakuvatalalila vandu vangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Penapo Sauli akamuhegelela Samweli peavili papipi na limulyangu la muji na akamjovela, “Chondi niyupa unilangisayi nyumba ya mundu mwailola gala geilola Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli akamuyangula Sauli, “Nene ndi mundu uyo mweilola. Mulongolela mkwela muhamba pandu pa kutetela, muni lelu yati mwilya pamonga na nene na yati nikukujovela mambu goha gegavii mu mtima waku, na chilau lukela yati nikukuleka uhamba. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Kugavala mapunda gegahovalili tangiya magono gadatu gegapitili, ukoto kugaholalela, genago gamali kuwonekana. Wu, ndi yani Vaisilaeli vakumgana? Wu, veve lepi pamonga na vandu voha va mu nyumba ya dadi waku?” <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli akayangula, “Nene namundu wa likabila la Benjamini, likabila lidebe pagati ya makabila goha ga Isilaeli. Na lukolo lwangu ndi ludebe kuliku lukolo zoha za likabila la Benjamini. Ndava kyani hinu ukunijovela nene lijambu lenili?” <verse eid="1SA 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ndi Samweli akavapeleka Sauli na mtumisi waki vatama pandu pa utopesa neju pamonga na vandu vevagongoliwi, kwavili na vandu ngati selasini vevagongoliwi. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli akamujovela mweiteleka, “Letayi lilundu la nyofu lenakupelili, lila lenakujovili ulivika pamuhana.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Mweiteleka yula ndi akahamba akaleta liwondo loha akalivika palongolo ya Sauli. Ndi Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Lyayi Chenichi ndi chechitendekiwi ndava yaku. Muni lavaguliwi ndava ya lijambu lelini, muni ulyayi pamonga na vayehe.” Penapo Sauli akalya pamonga na Samweli ligono lenilo. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Pevahelili kuhuma kunani pandu pa kutetela, Samweli akalongela na Sauli kuchumba cha kudali.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli akumunyala Sauli mahuta avya nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Pevayimwiki lukela pee, Samweli akamukemela Sauli kuhuma ku golofa kula, akamujovela, “Jitendekeha hinu yati nikukuleka uhamba.” Sauli peamali kujitendekeha ndi voha vavili, Sauli na Samweli vakahuma kuvala. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Pevahikili mu mbaka wa muji Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Mjovelayi mtumisi waku alongolelayi palongolo yitu.” Mtumisi peamalili kulongolela ndi Samweli akamjovela Sauli, “Linda chidoga nikujovelayi geajovili Chapanga kukuvala veve.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Kangi Samweli akatola kachupa kadebe ka mahuta akamuyitalila Sauli ku mutu, akamukumbatila na kumujovela, “Bambu Chapanga akusopili mahuta muni uvyayi mtalalila wa vandu vaki vevavi pa mulima waki. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Petilagana na nene lelu, yati ukongana na vandu vavili papipi na litinda la Laheli, ku Selisa ku mubaka wa Benjamini. Yati vaku jovela kuvya mapunda gala gewahambili kugalonda gawonikini. Dadi waku alekili kuholalela mapunda gegahovalili, na hinu akuholalela veve, na akujikota, ‘Yati nikumpata wuli mwana wangu?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Ukawuka penapo uhamba ku mkongo uvaha weukemiwa mwaloni weuvii ku Taboli, pandu penapo yati ukonganeka na vagosi vadatu vevihamba ku Beteli kumuwusila teta Chapanga. Pagati yavi mumonga ihuta mene zidebezidebe zidatu, na yungi agegili mabumunda gadatu, na wadatu agegili kahaku ka chikumba kekamemili divayi. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Yati vakukujambusa na kukupela mabumunda gavili, na veve yati upokela mabumunda genago. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Kangi peuhika ku Gibea ya Chapanga, pandu pevaviki kambi manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti, pepavili papipi na muji penapo yati ukonganeka na msambi wa vamulota vihelela kuhuma pandu pa kunena ya kutetela kuni vitova kanjeke na ng'oma hidebe na vitolilo na lilimba kuni viwusa ulota. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga yati ukuyingila chimakakala, na veve yati utumbula kuwusa ulota pamonga navu na veve yati ung'anamuswa kuvya wamundu mbwina neju. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Lukumbi mambu genago pegakumwangilayi, ukitayi chochoha cheuganikiwa kukita, muni Chapanga avii pamonga na veve. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Yati ukunilongolela kuhamba ku muji wa Giligali, na nene yati nikukubwelela kwenuko kuwusa teta za kutinyiswa na teta za uteke. Yati ukunilindila penapo kwa magono saba mbaka nibwelayi kukulangisa chakuhenga.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli peawukili ndu kulekana na Samweli, Chapanga akaunganamusa mtima wa Sauli. Goha geajoviwi na Samweli gakahumalila ligono lilalila. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli na mtumisi waki pevahikili ku Gibea, vakakonganeka na msambi wa vamulota. Mpungu wa Chapanga ukamuyingila chimakakala, na mwene akatumbula kuwusa ulota pamonga navu. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Vandu vevammanyili Sauli tangiya kadeni, pevamuweni iwusa ulota ndi vakakotana, “Chimukolili kyani mwana wa Kishi? Wu, Sauli na mwene mlota mewa?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mundu mmonga mkolonjinji wa penapo akakota, “Wu, dadi wavi ndi yani?” Kwahumalili luhumu lwelujova, “Wu, Sauli mewa ndi mmonga wa vamlota?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli peamalili kuwusa ulota, akakwela kuhamba ku chitumbi pandu pa kutetela. <verse eid="1SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Dadi waki mdebe Sauli peavaweni Sauli na muhengaji waki, akavakota, “Mwahambili kwoki?” Sauli akayangula, “Tahambili kugalonda mapunda. Nambu petasindwili kugawona, tikamuhambila Samweli.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Dadi waki mdogo yula akamjovela Sauli, “Chondi, nijovelayi cheakujovili Samweli.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli akamyangula, “Atijovili hotohoto kuvya mapunda gamali kuwonekana.” Nambu Sauli amujovili lepi dadi waki mdebe kuvya Samweli amujovili kuvya yati ivya nkosi.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli ikokoswa kuvya nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samweli akavakemela Vandu voha vakonganeka palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga uko ku Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Pevabwelili ndi akavajovela, “Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli ijova naha, ‘Navagombwili nyenye Mwavaizilaeli kuhuma ku mulima wa Misili, na navawusili kuhuma kwa Vamisili na vankosi voha vevavang'ahili nyenye. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Nambu lelu munibelili nene Chapanga winu, mwenavagombwili kuhuma mu mang'aisu na mtau, na nyenye mwijova mwigana nkosi. Hinu mbwela palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kuni muvii mu makabila ginu na mu lukolo zinu.’” <verse eid="1SA 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Samweli peagakonganisi makabila goha ga Isilaeli pamonga, na Bambu Chapanga akalihagula likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Akavaleta palongolo vandu va likabila la Benjamini lukolo kwa lukolo, na lukolo lwa Matili lukahaguliwa. Kangi vakakina gudugudu, na Sauli mwana wa Kishi akahaguliwa. Nambu pevamulondili Sauli mwene vamuweni lepi. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Penapo vakamukota kavili Bambu Chapanga, “Wu, mundu mwenuyu amali kubwela penapa?” Bambu Chapanga akavayangula, “Ena avile, nambu ajihihi pala pamizigu.” <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Hinu vandu vakajumba kuhamba kumtola Sauli na kumuleta palongolo ya vandu. Sauli peayimili pagati ya vandu, avili mtali kuliku vandu voha, na voha vamuhikila mu mavega. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli akavajovela vandu voha, “Wu, mukumuwona? Mwenuyu ndi mundu mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga pagati yinu, kawaka yungi mweavii ngati mwenuyu pagati ya vandu voha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ndi vandu voha vakajova, “Nkosi atama wumi wa magono gamahele.”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Samweli akavakokosela vandu voha uhotola na mahengu geiganikiwa kukita nkosi, kangi akagayandika mahengu genago goha mu chitabu na kuchivika palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Kangi Samweli akavalaga vandu na kuvajovela voha vakiliwukayi ku nyumba zavi. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Mewa Sauli akahamba ku nyumba yaki ku Gibea, kuni ihindikiswa na vandu vakekesi va ngondo vala vevalongwiswi na Chapanga kukita chenicho. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Nambu pavili na vandu vangi vevanaluhonda, vakajova, “Wu, mundu mwenuyu yati ihotola kutisangula?” Venavo vakamuvevesa Sauli na vamupelili lepi njombi yoyoha. Nambu Sauli aguni nuu.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli akuvahotola Vaamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Pewapitili mwehi umonga Nahashi nkosi wa Vaamoli akahamba kuuzangila muji wa Yabeshi Gileadi. Vakolonjinji va pa Yabeshi Gileadi vakamujovela Nahashi, “Kita malaganu na tete na tete yati tikukuhengela.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Nahashi akavayangula, “Malaganu genivika na nyenye ndi aga, mwavoha yati nikuvatupula lihu limonga la upandi wa kulyela, chenicho chikuvapela soni vandu voha va pa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Vachilongosi va pa Yabeshi vakamujovela, “Tipela magono saba muni tituma vandu pa mulima woha wa Isilaeli vakalonda mundu wa kutisangula. Nambu ngati kusi mundu yoyoha wa kutisangula, ndi yati tikujileta na kuvya pahi yaku.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Vandu vala pevahikili ku muji wa Gibea, kweitama Sauli ndi vakatumbula kukokosa mambu genago na vandu voha vakavemba kwa lwami. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Lukumbi lulolo Sauli akiliwukayi kuhuma ku mgunda pamonga na ng'ombi yaki ya kulimila, ndi akakota, “Vandu venava vana kyani? Ndava kyani vivemba?” Ndi vakamukokosela mambu gevakokwisi vandu vevabwelili kuhuma ku Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sauli peayuwini mambu genago, Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukamubwelela kwa makakala, na mwene akavya na ligoga neju. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Akatola ng'ombi zigosi zivili akazidumulana hipandi hipandi, akatuma vandu vahipitisayi hipandi yeniyo pa Isilaeli poha kuni vijova, “Mundu yoyoha mweibela kumulanda Sauli na Samweli ku ngondo, ng'ombi zaki yati zikitiwa chenicho.” Vandu va pa Isilaeli vakavya na wogohi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, ndi vandu voha vakawuka, vakawungana naku na kuvya chindu chimonga. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli peavakonganisi Vaisilaeli ku Bezeki akavya na vandu kuhuma ku Isilaeli laki hidatu na va kuhuma ku Yuda elufu selasini. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Vakavajovela vajumbi vevabwelili kukokosa kuhuma ku Yabeshi, “Mukavajovelayi vakolonjinji va ku Yabeshi Gileadi, chilau muhi lilanga peliyaka neju, yati muvya mumali kusanguliwa.” Vakolonjinji va pa Yabeshi pevayuwini malovi genago ndi vakasangaluka neju. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ndi vakavajovela Vaamoni, “Chilau yati tikujileta na kuvya pahi yinu, na nyenye yati mukutikitila chochoha chemwigana.” <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Chilau yaki Sauli akagavanisa vandu vaki misambi hidatu, lukela pehe vakayingi pa kambi ya Vaamoni na kuvahanganila, vakavakoma mbaka muhi. Vala vevasumukini vakapechengana kila mundu akatila mwene. <verse eid="1SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Penapo Vaisilaeli vakamkota Samweli, “Vavili kwoki vandu vala vevajovayi Sauli ihotola lepi kuvya nkosi witu? Tiletelayi vandu venavo tivakome.” <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Nambu Sauli akavajovela, “Kawaka mundu yoyoha mweikomiwayi lelu, muni lelu Bambu Chapanga avagombwili Vaisilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Kangi Samweli akavajovela vandu, “Tihambayi tavoha ku Giligali tikakokosayi kavili kuvya Sauli ndi nkosi witu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Vandu voha vakahamba ku Giligali, na pevahikili kwenuko vakamkokosa Sauli kuvya nkosi. Vakamuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta za uteke, Sauli pamonga na vandu voha va Isilaeli vakakita mselebuko uvaha.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samweli akuvalaga Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Kangi Samweli akavajovela Vaisilaeli voha, “Goha gemunijovili nigayuwini na nivapelili nkosi winu mweakuvatalalila. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Hinu muvii na nkosi mweakuvalongosa. Nene hinu namugogolo na ninahulia, na vana vangu va chigosi vavili pamonga na nyenye. Navii chilongosi winu tangia usongolo wangu mbaka lelu. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Nene niyimili apa, ngati nikitili uhakau wowoha, mkokosa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na palongolo ya nkosi waki mweamuhagwili. Wu, ninyagili ng'ombi amala lipunda la mundu yoyoha? Yani mwenimukongili? Yani mwenimuwonili pagati yinu? Wu, nipokili hongo kwa mundu yoyoha ndava nikoto kuhamula cha uchakaka? Ngati nikiti genago, nene yati nikuvawuyasila.” <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Vandu vakamuyangula, “Pehe, utikongili lepi, wala watiwonili lepi na utolili lepi chindu chochoha cha mundu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli akavayangula, “Bambu Chapanga ndi shahidi winu, na nkosi waki mweamuhagwili lelu ndi shahidi ngati muniweni kawaka chindu chihakau chanikitili.” Vene vakamyangula, “Mwene Bambu Chapanga ndi shahidi.” <verse eid="1SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samweli akayendelela kujova, “Bambu Chapanga ndi mweavahagwili Musa na Aluni na kuvawusa vagogo vinu ku mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Hinu muyimayi bahopo pemuvili muni tigalola palongolo ya Bambu matendu ga chakaka geagakitili mwene Bambu Chapanga kwinu nyenye na kwa vagogo vinu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />“Yakobo na vandu va mu nyumba yaki pevahambili ku Misili na Vamisili pevavang'ahili nyenye, ndi vagogo vinu vakamuvembela Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akavatuma Musa na Haluni, na vene vakavawusa vagogo vinu ku mulima wa Misili na kuvakita mutama mu mulima uwu. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Nambu vene vakamukosiwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wavi, na mwene akamukita Sisela mweavili mukulu wa manjolinjoli ga Hazoli avatova, mewa vabuniwi na Vafilisiti na nkosi wa ku Moabu. Vandu va milima yeniyo vakomini na vagogo vinu na kuvahotola. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Vagogo vinu vakamuvembela Bambu Chapanga kuni vijova, ‘Tibudili kwa kukuleka veve Bambu Chapanga, na kwa kuihengela michapanga Baali na Ashitaloti. Hinu tisangulayi tikoto kutoviwa na vamakoko vitu, na tete yati tikukuhengela veve.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akamutuma Yelubaali, na badayi akamutuma Balaki, kangi akamutuma Yefita, na pamwisu akanituma nene Samweli. Na Bambu Chapanga akavasangula muwuka kwa vamakoko vinu vevavatindili pandi zoha, na nyenye mkatama cha uteke. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Nambu pemwamuweni nkosi Nahashi wa Vaamoni abwelili kuvatova, mwamubelili Bambu Chapanga mweavii nkosi winu, mukanijovela, ‘Pehe, tigana nkosi atitalalila.’”<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Hinu, nkosi mwemujihagulili ndi uyu apa, mwamuyupili Bambu Chapanga avapelayi nkosi na mwene avapelili nkosi avatalalilayi. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Ngati mukamtopesa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu na kumuhengela na kuyidakila changali kuleka kulanda malagizu gaki, nyenye mwavene na nkosi winu mweakuvatalalila, mukamulandayi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ndi mambu yati gakuvahambila bwina. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Nambu ngati yati mukumuyuwanila lepi Bambu Chapanga, na kuleka kukamula malagizu gaki, mwene yati akuvabuna nyenye na nkosi winu ngati cheavabunili vagogo vinu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Hinu, muyima yati mukulilola lijambu livaha leakulikitayi Bambu Chapanga palongolo yinu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Wu, lukumbi ulu si ndi chilangasi na ndi lukumbi lwa kubena nganu? Nambu nene yati nikumuyupa Bambu Chapanga aletayi fula na mbamba. Na nyenye yati mwimanya kuvya lijambu linu lemukitili la kujiyupila nkosi winu chelivii lihakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ndi Samweli akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga, mu ligono lilolo Bambu Chapanga akatonyesa fula na mbamba. Vandu vakamuyogopa neju Bambu Chapanga na Samweli mewa. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Hinu vakamujovela Samweli, “Chondi utiyupilayi kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, tete tavatumisi vaku tikotokayi kufwa; muni uhakau witu uyonjosiki kuvya uvaha neju kwa kugana kwitu kuvya na nkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli akavayangula, “Mukotoka kuyogopa hati ngati mukitili uhakau uhu woha, mukotoka kuleka kumulanda Bambu Chapanga, na mumuhengelayi kwa mitima yinu yoha. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Mukotoka kuhilanda michapanga ya makeu yeyangavya na chindu na hihotola lepi kuvasangula, muni yihotola lepi kukita chindu chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Ndava ya liina laki likulu, Bambu Chapanga yati akuvataga lepi vandu vaki, muni Bambu aganiswi kuvakita muvya mwavandu vaki. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Nambu nene yati nileka lepi kuvayupila kwa Bambu Chapanga, muni nikakitayi chenicho yati nivya nimubudili Bambu Chapanga. Ndava yeniyo yati niyendelela kuvawula muni mutama kwa kukita mambu gabwina na gegiyidakiliwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Hinu nyenye mumtopesa Bambu Chapanga lukumbi lwoha na kumuhengela cha uchakaa na kwa mitima yinu yoha. Mugakumbukayi gala mambu gakulu geavakitili. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Nambu ngati mukayendelelayi kukita gahakahu, ndi yati mukomakeswa nyenye pamonga na nkosi winu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vitovana ngondo na Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli peavii nkosi ndi avili na miyaka selasini, na akatalalila pa Isilaeli kwa miyaka alubaini na hivili. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli avahagwili Vaisilaeli elufu hidatu na pagati yavi akavatola elufu hivili akavya navu ku Mikimashi ku mulima wa hitumbi ya ku Beteli. Na vandu vangi elufu yimonga vakavya na Yonatani ku muji wa Gibea kumulima wa Benjamini. Na vala vandu vangi vevasigalili akavajovela kila mmonga awuya kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonatani akavazangila manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti vevavikili kambi ku Geba, na Vafilisiti voha vakayuwana lijambu lenilo. Penapo ndi Sauli akavajovela vandu vabetayi mapenenga pa mulima woha wa Isilaeli na kujova, “Vaebulania vayuwanila.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Vaisilaeli voha vayuwini kuvya Sauli avatovili manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti vevavili pa kambi, na Vafilisiti vakatumbula kuvavenga neju Vaisilaeli, penapo vandu vakakemewa kuhamba kuwungana na Sauli ku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Vafilisiti vakakonganeka pamonga muni vatovana na Veisilaeli, kuni vavili na mutuka za ngondo elufu selasini na manjolinjoli elufu sita vakwela falasi na msambi wa manjolinjoli vevigenda kwa magendelu vavii vamahele ngati msavati wa kubwani. Voha venavo vakakwela na kuvika kambi yavi uko ku Mikimashi kuupandi welihumila lilanga wa muji wa Beti Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Vaisilaeli pevaweni kuvya vavili mu mang'aiso na manjolinjoli vavi vibuniwa, vakatumbula kujihiha. Vangi vakajihiha mu mbugu na vangi ku dasi na vangi mu malindi, vangi mu matalawu na vangi mu magodi na vangi mu hiliva. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Vaebulania vangi vakayomboka mfuleni Yoludani vakahamba mbaka ku mulima wa Gadi na ku mulima wa Gileadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Nambu Sauli avili akona ku Giligali, na vandu voha vakamulanda kuni vindendema.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli akamulindila Samweli mu magono saba, ngati Samweli cheajovili. Nambu Samweli abwelili lepi ku Giligali na vandu vakatumbula kupechengana. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ndi Sauli akavajovela vandu, “Muniletelayi teta zinu za kutinyiswa na teta za uteke.” Na mwene Sauli akawusa teta za kutinyiswa. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Sauli peamalili ndu kutinyisa teta, Samweli abwelili. Sauli akahuma kuvala kuhamba kumpokela Samweli na kumjambusa. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli akamukota, “Ukitili kyani?” Sauli akayangula, “Penaweni vandu vipechengana na veve wabwelili lepi mu lukumbi lwewajovili, na penaweni Vafilisiti vajitendekihi kwa ngondo uko ku Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />ndi nikaholalela kuvya Vafilisiti yati vibwela kunihanganila ku Giligali na navii nakona nangamuyupa Bambu Chapanga atitangatila. Ndava yeniyo yikanigana niwusayi teta ya kutinyisa.” <verse eid="1SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli akamuyangula Sauli, “Ukitili uyimu.” “Walandili lepi malagizu geakupelili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku. Nambu ngati ngeulandayi, mwene ngaaukitili unkosi waku usindimala magono goha pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Nambu hinu unkosi waku yati uyendelela lepi kuvya magono goha, muni veve wakitili lepi geigana Bambu Chapanga, hinu Bambu Chapanga mwene amulondili mundu yungi mweakuuganisa mtima wa Bambu, na amuhagwili avya chilongosi wa vandu vaki.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Penapo Samweli akawuka ku Giligali akahamba ku Gibea mu mulima wa Benjamini. Na mwene Sauli peavavalingi manjolinjoli veavili navu, ndi vavii manjolinjoli miya sita. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli pamonga na Yonatani mwana waki pamonga na manjolinjoli voha vevii navu ndi vakavika kambi ku Gibea pa mulima wa Benjamini, Vafilisiti na vene vakavika kambi ku Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Vafilisiti vakawuka pa kambi yavi na kuhamba kuvazangila kuni vavii misambi hidatu. Msambi umonga wahambili ku Ofula ku mulima wa Shuali, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />msambi wungi ukahamba ku Beti Holoni, na msambi wungi wa datu ukahamba ku mbaka kuhambila ku ligema la Seboimu lelilolesana na lugangatu. <verse eid="1SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili lepi na mundu yoyoha mweakita lufumbu pa mulima woha wa Isilaeli, ndava Vafilisiti vabelili kuvaleka Vaebulania vajiwula kujitendekelela mapanga amala migoha. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Penapo kila Muisilaeli akahamba kwa Vafilisiti ndava ya kunola magela gegihutwa na vinyama na magela ga kulima kwa mawoko na mavagu na hikwakwa. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Kunola ligela la kulima na ng'ombi Vaisilaeli valipayi gilamu nane za hipandi ya madini ga feza, na gilamu mcheche kwa kunolela livagu amala chikwakwa. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ngondo peyahumalila kwavili lepi na linjolinjoli pagati ya vala voha vevavili na Sauli na Yonatani mweavili na upanga amala mgoha, nambu nga Sauli na Yonatani mwana waki ndu ndi vevavii navyu. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Hinu Vafilisiti vakapeleka manjolinjoli kuhamba kuyiyangalila njila ya ku Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonatani na msongolo waki vakuvakoma Vafilisiti vamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Ligono limonga Yonatani mwana wa nkosi Sauli amjovili msongolo mweigega vindu vyaki vya ngondo, “Bwela tiyomboka kumwambu ku kambi ya Vafilisiti.” Nambu Yonatani amujovili lepi dadi waki. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli avii atamili pahi ya chimuwili cha mkomamanga ku Migiloni, kuvala ya muji wa Gibea, penapo avii na manjolinjoli mia sita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Pagati yavi avili Ahiya, mweawalili kakoti kahupi ka chimteta, mwenuyo avili mwana wa Ahiatibu mulongo waki Ikabodi, mwana wa Finehasi na mjukulu wa Eli, mteta wa Bambu Chapanga wa ku Shilo. Kawaka mundu mweamanyili kuvya Yonatani awukili pa kambi.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mundila yeaganikiwayi kupita Yonatani ndava ya kuhika pevaviki kambi Vafilisiti mwavili na matalau gavili gegavi na mihelelu ikali, upandi uwu na upandi wungi. Litalau limonga lakemiwa Bosesi na litalau lingi lakemiwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Muhelelu umonga wavili ku upandi wa kasikazini kuni ulolesana na muji wa Mikimashi na muhelelu wungi wavili ku upandi wa kusini kuni ulolesana na muji wa Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonatani akamujovela msongolo yula mweamugegili vindu vyaki vya ngondo, “Bwela tihambayi ku upandi wungi wa kambi ya vandu vevangadumuliwa jandu. Pangi Bambu Chapanga yati akutitangatila, muni Bambu Chapanga isangula lepi ndava ya umahele amala udebe wa vandu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Msongolo mweamugegela vindu vya ngondo yula akamujovela, “Ena! Nene nivii pamonga na veve muni maholo gaku giwanangana na maholo gangu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonatani akamjovela, “Ena, mpangu wangu ndi uwu, yati tiyomboka na kuvahambila vandu vala muni vatiwonayi. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Ngati vakatijovelayi, ‘Mutilindilayi bahopo tibwela kwinu.’ Yati tiyima bahopo petivyayi yati tihamba lepi kwavi. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Nambu vakatijovelayi, ‘Mkwela mbwela kwitu.’ Yati tikwela muni chenicho ndi yati chivya ulangiso kuvya Bambu Chapanga atikitili tivatovayi.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Penapo Yonatani na msongolo yula vakahuma muni Vafilisiti vavawonayi. Kangi Vafilisiti pevavawene vakajova, “Muvalolayi vala Vaebulania vihuma mu malindi kwevajihihili.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Vafilisiti vevavili pa kambi vakamukemela Yonatani na msongolo mweakumugegela vindu vyaki vya ngondo, “Mukwelayi mubwela kuni muchikolele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Yonatani akamujovela msongolo yula, “Tiyeni ukwelayi pamonga na nene, muni Bambu Chapanga yati akutitangatila tivatovayi.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Penapo Yonatani akakwela kunani cha kukwava, na msongolo yula akamulanda mumbele. Yonatani akavatova Vafilisiti na kuvagwisa pahi na msongolo yula apitayi kuvakomakesa. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Pevavatovili mala ya kutumbula, Yonatani na msongolo waki vavakomili vandu ngati ishilini ku luvanja lweluhika uvaha wa heka yapinga. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Manjolinjoli voha vakawehuka, na manjolinjoli vala vevavii pa kambi vakatilila ku migunda, na vala vevavii mu ulonda na vevizangila vandendemiki na ndima ya pala pevavili yikanyugusika. Bambu Chapanga ndi mweakitili kuwehuka kwenuko kuhumilayi.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakuvatova Vafilisiti ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Vamang'omesi va Sauli vevavili ku Gibea ku mulima wa Benjamini vavawene manjolinjoli vamahele vitila cha kupechengana. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli akavajovela manjolinjoli vevavii pamonga naku, “Mujivalangayi muni timanyayi kuvya vayani vevangavya peapa.” Pevamalili kujivalanga ndi vakamanya kuvya Yonatani na msongolo waki mweakumgegela vindu vya ngondo vavili lepi. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli akamujovela mteta Ahiya, “Liletayi apa Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga.” Magono genago Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga lavili kwa Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Lukumbi Sauli pealongelayi na mteta, lwami lwa wogohi lwa vandu vevatila lwayonjosiki neju ku kambi ya Vafilisiti. Penapo Sauli akamujovela mteta Ahiya, “Leka, kotoka kulileta Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga!” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Kangi Sauli na manjolinjoli vaki vakajitendekeha na kuhamba ku ngondo kukomana na Vafilisiti. Nambu vakavakolela Vafilisiti vawewiki neju, vitovana vene kwa vene kwa mapanga gavi. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Penapo Vaebulania vevavii ku upandi wa Vafilisiti tangia kadeni ndi vakawuka na kuhamba kuwungana na Vaisilaeli vevavili pamonga na Sauli na Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Mewawa na Vaisilaeli voha vevajihihili ku mumlima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu, pevayuwini kuvya Vafilisiti vitila, na vene mewa vakavalandalila na kuvakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Paligono lenilo Bambu Chapanga avakitili Vaisilaeli vahotola na ngondo yikadandasika mbaka kupita ku Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mambu gegahumalili peyamaliki ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Ligono lenilo Vaisilaeli vavii legelege neju muni Sauli avalapakisi vandu akajova, “Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweilya chakulya lelu kwakona lilanga kutipama na kwakona nene nangavawuyasila mbunu vamakoko vangu.” Hinu ligono lenilo kawaka mundu mwealili chakulya chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Manjolinjoli voha vakahamba kudasi, na vene vakawona wuchi uvii panani ya ndima. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Pavayingili mu dasi vakawona wuchi uchuluzika, nambu kawaka mundu mwealili, ndava vayogwipi likoto levalapakiswi na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Nambu Yonatani avii lepi lukumbi dadi waki peavalapisayi vandu. Hinu akagolosa ndonga yeavili nayu, akayijwiga palisega la wuchi, kangi akamyanga wuchi wenuwo, na penapo akapata makakala. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Mundu mmonga akamjovela, “Dadi waku avalapakisi vandu na kujova, ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweilya chakulya lelu.’ Ndi mana tivi legelege ndava ya njala.”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonatani akamyangula, “Dadi wangu avang'ahili vandu! Hinu nene nivii na makakala muni nimyangili wuchi chidogo. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ngati manjolinjoli vitu ngavalili chakulya chila chevanyagili kwa vamakoko vitu, ngatipatili makakala na lelu ngativakomili Vafilisiti vamahele.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Ligono lila Vaisilaeli vavatovili Vafilisiti, tangia ku Mikimashi mbaka ku Aiyaloni. Makakala gakavamalika Vaisilaeli ndava ya njala. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Hinu vakajumbalila vindu vyevavanyagili vamakoko vala, vakatola mambelele na ng'ombi zigosi vakahinja, kwakona ngasi yangamalika kuhuma mu nyofu yeniyo, vakayivaula na kulya. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Linjolinjoli mmonga akamujovela Sauli, “Lola vandu vakumubudila Bambu Chapanga kwa kulya nyofu yeyivi na ngasi.” Sauli akavajovela vandu, “Nyenye mwavasadika lepi kwa Bambu Chapanga, mulibilindusayi liganga livaha libwela apa penivili nene.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Kangi Sauli akavajovela, “Muhambayi pagati ya vandu na muvajovelayi naha, kila mmonga aletayi ng'ombi na limbelele laki apa alihinjayi, aleka ngasi yihulula yoha ndi ayitendekeha na kulya. Vakotokayi kumuhokela Bambu Chapanga kwa kulya nyofu yeyivi na ngasi.” Hinu kila mmonga akaleta ng'ombi yaki kilu yeniyo, akayihinja pandu pala. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Kangi Sauli akamujengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pa kuwusila teta, penapo ndi pavili pandu pa kutumbula pa kuwusila teta, Sauli peamujengili Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Kangi Sauli akavajovela vandu, “Tihambayi tikavazangilayi Vafilisiti kilu iyi, na kuvatova na kuvanyaga vindu vyavi mbaka peyihika lukela, na yati tikotokumleka mundu yoyoha mweivya mumi.” Vandu vakamujovela, “Kitayi chochoha cheuwona kuvya chabwina.” Nambu mteta akavajovela, “Mulindila hoti timukota Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ndi Sauli akamukota Bambu Chapanga, “Wu, nihambayi nikavazangila Vafilisiti? Wu, petihambayi yati ukutikita tivatovayi?” Nambu Bambu Chapanga amuyangwili lepi mu ligono lenilo. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Sauli akajova, “Mubwelayi apa mwavachilongosi mwavoha va manjolinjoli, muni timanyayi tibudili kyani lelu. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi na mweakuyisangula Isilaeli, yeyoha mweabudili hati ngati mwana wangu Yonatani, iganikiwa akomiwayi.” Nambu kawaka mundu mweayangwili linenu loloha. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Penapo Sauli akavajovela Vaisilaeli voha, “Nyenye mwavoha muyimayi kula, nene na mwana wangu Yonatani yati tiyima kuni.” Vene vakamuyangula, “Kitayi chochoha cheuwona kuvya chabwina.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Kangi Sauli akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga, akajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli ndava kyani waniyangwili lepi nene namuhengaji waku? Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ngati mwenibudili ndi nene amala mwana wangu Yonatani ndi uhamulayi kwa liganga la Ulimu. Nambu ngati vevabudili ndi vandu vaku va Isilaeli ndi uhamulayi kwa liganga la Tumimu.” Penapo Yonatani na Sauli vakawonekana kuvya vahokili, nambu vandu vawonikini kuvya vahoki lepi. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli akajova, “Mukinayi gudugudu ndava ya nene na mwana wangu Yonatani.” Penapo gudugudu yikalangisa kuvya Yonatani ndi mweahokili. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ndi Sauli akamujovela Yonatani, “Nijovelayi cheukitili.” Yonatani akayangula, “Nalili wuchi chidogo kwa ndonga yangu. Nivii apa nijitendekihi kufwa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli akajova, “Bambu Chapanga anikomayi ngati veve Yonatani yati ukomiwa lepi.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Nambu vandu vakamujovela Sauli, “Ndava kyani Yonatani akomiwayi mundu mweavakitili Vaisilaeli vahotolayi? Yikotoka kuvya chenicho kwaki. Tilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavili mumi, hati luyunju lumonga lwa mutu waki yati lugwa lepi pahi. Cheachikitili lelu ndi achikitili kwa utangatila wa Bambu Chapanga.” Penapo vandu vakamusangula Yonatani na mwene akomiwi lepi.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Penapo Sauli akaleka kuvalandalila Vafilisiti, na vene Vafilisiti vakawuka na kukiliwuka ku mulima wavi.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utalalila wa Sauli na vandu va mu nyumba yaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli peavili nkosi wa Isilaeli, akakomana na vamakoko vaki va pandi zoha. Akomini na Vamoabu na Vaamoli na Vaedomu na vankosi va Soba na Vafilisiti. Kila mweatovini nayu ndi amuhotwili. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Akatovana chikekesi na akavahotola Vaamaleki. Akavasangula Vaisilaeli kuhuma kwa vandu vevavazangili.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Vana vagosi va Sauli ndi vavii Yonatani na Ishivi na Maliki Shua. Na vana vadala vavii vavili, mvelekanu wa kutumbula akemiwa Melabu na mbena waki akemiwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Mdala wa Sauli akemiwa Ahinoamu mwana wa Ahimaasi. Mkulu wa manjolinjoli va Sauli akemiwayi Abuneli, mwana wa Neli, na Neli avili dadi mdebe wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Dadi waki Sauli akemiwi Kishi na dadi waki Abuneli akemiwi Neli, venavo voha vavili vavii vana vagosi va Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Lukumbi lwoha lwa utalalila wa Sauli kwavili na ngondo yivaha pagati ya Vaisilaeli na Vafilisiti, Sauli peamuweni mundu mweavi na makakala amala mkekesi amuyingisayi mu manjolinjoli gaki.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Sauli itovana ngondo na Vaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Bambu Chapanga anitumili nikuyitilayi mahuta uvyayi nkosi wa vandu vaki va Isilaeli. Hinu yuwanilayi malovi ga Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Bambu Chapanga mweavi na makakala goha ijova naha, ‘Yati nikuvabuna Vaamaleki ndava vavatovili Vaisilaeli pevahumayi ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Hinu hambayi ukavahanganilayi na kuyongomesa vindu vyavi vyoha. Ukoto kuleka chindu chochoha, nambu uvakomayi voha vagosi na vadala na vana vadebe na vana vevinyonga pamonga na ng'ombi na mambelele na ngamiya na mapunda.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Ndi Sauli akavakemela manjolinjoli vaki ku Telaimu, manjolinjoli vevigenda kwa magendelu vakavya laki zivili vevahumili ku Isilaeli, na vevahumili ku Yuda vavili elufu kumi. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Kangi Sauli na vandu vaki vakahamba ku muji wa Amaleki, vakajihiha mu ligema muni kuvanyemelela. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli akavajovela Vakeni, “Mujibagula pagati ya Vaamaleki, ngati mukabelayi yati nikuvakoma nyenye pamonga na vene. Muwukayi ndava nyenye mwavakitili gabwina Vaisilaeli pevawukayi ku Misili.” Ndi Wakeni vakajibagula pagati ya Vaamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Kangi Sauli akavatova Vaamaleki tangia ku Havila mbaka ku Shuli yeyivii ku upandi welihumila lilanga wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Akamkamula Agagi nkosi wa Vaamaleki kuni avii mumi na kuvakoma vandu vaki voha kwa upanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Nambu Sauli pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki vamulekili mumi Agagi pamonga na mambelele gegakulupalili na ng'ombi zabwina na mipapakasi yaki na vanamambelele pamonga na kila chindu chechawonakini kuvya chabwina. Vindu vyenivyo vaganili lepi kuvikomakesa njwee, nambu vindu vyevyaveviswi na hinyama yeyigandili vahikomakisi njwee.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli ibelelewa akoto kuyendelela kuvya nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Samweli, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Ninung'unika kuvya nimukitili Sauli avyayi nkosi, mwene alekili kunilanda nene na ikamula lepi malagizu gangu.” Samweli akanung'unika na akamuvembele Bambu Chapanga kilu yoha. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samweli akayimuka lukela pee akahamba kukongana na Sauli, kwenuko akajoviwa kuvya Sauli ahambili ku Kalimeli, na kwenuko ajiyimamisili liganga la ukumbuso wa ukulu waki, na hinu awuyili na kuhamba ku Giligali. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samweli peakonganiki na Sauli, ndi Sauli akamujovela Samweli, “Umotiswayi na Bambu Chapanga! Nigayidakili gala geanijovili Bambu Chapanga nigakitayi.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli akamkota, “Kuvemba kwenuku kwa mambelele kweniyuwana mu makutu gangu, na kuvemba kwenuku kwa ng'ombi kwenikuyuwana ndi chindu kiki?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli akamuyangula, “Manjolinjoli vaviletili kuhuma kwa Vaamaleki, vakomili lepi ng'ombi na mambelele gegakulupalili, vavilekili muni vamuwusilayi luteta lwa kutinyiswa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nambu hingi yoha tahikomakisi njwee.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Gunayi! Lindila nikujovela geanijovili Bambu Chapanga lelu kilu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sauli akayangula, “Nijovela.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli akamujovela, “Pamonga kuvya kadeni wamwene wajiweni kuvya wamudebe pamihu paku wamwene, wu, wakitiki lepi kuvya wachilongosi wa makabila ga Isilaeli? Bambu Chapanga akunyalili mahuta uvyayi nkosi wa Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Bambu Chapanga peakutumili akujovili, ‘Hamba ukavakomakesa njwee Vaamaleki vevabudili, ukatovanayi navu mbaka uvakoma voha.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Ndava kyani wamuyidakili lepi Bambu Chapanga? Ndava kyani wajumbalili kutola vindu na kukita uhakahu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli akayangula, “Chakaka nene nimuyidakili Bambu Chapanga, nahambili kula ngati cheanilagizi Bambu Chapanga, nivakomakisi Vaamaleki voha na nimuletili apa Agagi nkosi wa Vaamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Nambu manjolinjoli vangu vatolili mambelele na ng'ombi zezikulupalili pamonga na vindu vyoha vyevyavili vyabwina ndava ya kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku teta ya kutinyiswa ku Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Samweli akamkota, “Wu, wiholalela kuvya Bambu Chapanga igana teta za kutinyiswa na teta zingi kuliku kumyidakila mwene? Lola, chabwina Kumuyidakila mwene kuliku kuwusa teta, na chabwina kumuyuwanila mwene kuliku kuwusa mahuta ga limbelele ligosi. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kumng'anamukila Bambu Chapanga kuwanangana na uhakahu wa uhavi, na chinywinda ndi ngati uhakahu wa kufugamila vimong'omong'o. Ndava muni ubelili malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akubelili ukotoka kuvya nkosi.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Penapo Sauli akamujovela Samweli, “Chakaka nimbudili Bambu Chapanga, nikitili lepi geanijovili Bambu Chapanga na malagizu gaku, ndava navayogwipi vandu na nikakita gevigana vene. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Hinu nikukuyupa unilekekesayi kubuda kwangu, na ukiliwukayi pamonga na nene ndava nikamufugamilayi Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samweli akamuyangula, “Katu nihotola lepi kukiliwuka pamonga na veve. Veve wabelili malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga na mwene akubelili veve ukoto kuyendelela kuvya nkosi wa vandu vaki va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samweli peang'anamwiki kugana kuwuka, Sauli akakamula lugwinyilu lwa nyula ya Samweli na nyula yikapapuka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Penapo Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Kuhumila lelu Bambu Chapanga autolili unkosi wa Isilaeli kuhuma kwaku kwa makakala na yati akumupela Muisilaeli yungi mweavii mbwina kuliku veve. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga mweavi ukulu wa Vaisilaeli ijova lepi makehu, na ing'anamusa lepi geajovili. Muni mwene mundu lepi mbaka ang'anamusa maholo gaki.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli akamuyangula, “Nikitili uhakahu. Pamonga na naha nitopesayi palongolo ya vagogo va vandu vangu na Vaisilaeli. Niyidakilayi nikiliwukayi pamonga na veve nikamufugamilayi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ndi Samweli akakiliwuka pamonga na Sauli mbaka ku Giligali, na Sauli akamufugamila Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Ndi Samweli akajova, “Muniletelayi apa Agagi nkosi wa Vaamaleki.” Agagi akamuhambila Samweli kuni asangalwiki, muni aholalili kuvya yati ikomiwa lepi. <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Nambu Samweli akajova, “Ngati upanga waku chewavakitili vadala vamahele vakoto kuvya na vana, ndi na veve nyina waku yati ivya lepi na mwana pagati ya vadala.” Samweli akamudumulana Agagi hipandi hipandi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga ku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Pagenago Samweli akahamba ku Lama, na nkosi Sauli akakwela kukiliwuka ku nyumba yaki ku Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kuhumila ligono lenilo Samweli amuweni lepi kavili Sauli, nambu Samweli avii na uvinisu mu mtima ndava ya gala geakitili Sauli. Bambu Chapanga na mwene akavya ngolongondi ndava ya Sauli, muni amuhagwili avya nkosi wa Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Samweli akumyitila mahuta Daudi muni avya nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamkota Samweli, “Wu, yati uyendelela kumuvembela Sauli mbaka ndali? Veve umanyili kuvya nene nimubelili akoto kuvya nkosi wa vandu vangu Vaisilaeli. Hinu memesayi ling'elu laku mahuta, nikutuma uhamba ku muji wa Betelehemu. Kwenuko nimupatili nkosi pagati ya vana va mundu mweikemiwa Yese.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Nambu Samweli akakota, “Yati nihamba wuli? Sauli akayuwanayi mambu genago yati akunikoma!” Bambu Chapanga akamujovela, “Tolayi mpapakasi wa ng'ombi uhamba nawu, na ukahikayi kwenuko uvajovela nibwelili kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Umugongolelayi Yese avyayi peuwusa teta, na nene yati nikukulangisa chakukita. Na veve yati ukumuyitila mahuta mundu yula mwenikujovelayi.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli akakita ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamujovili. Akahamba ku Betilehemu, vagogo vachilongosi va muji vakahamba kumupokela kuni vindendemeka, vaka mukota, “Wu, ubwelili cha uteke?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli akavayangula, “Ena, nibwelili cha uteke. Nibwelili kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta za kutinyiswa. Mujitendekeha muni muyidakiliwa mu kufugama na tihamba tikawusa teta za kutinyiswa.” Samweli akavanyambisa Yese pamonga na vana vaki muni vayidakiliwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na akavagongolela na vene vawusa teta ya kutinyiswa.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Pevahikili, na Samweli peamuweni Eliabu ndi akajijovela mu mtima waki, “Mwenuyu mweayimili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, chakaka ndi mweahaguliwi na Bambu ayitiliwa mahuta avya nkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Samweli, “Kotoka kulola pamihu na utali weavili nawu. Nene nimubelili muni nilolokesa lepi ngati chavilolokesa vandu. Vandu vilolokesa ubwina wa kuvala nambu nene nilolokesa mu mtima.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ndi Yese akamuleta Abinadabu akamupitisa palongolo ya Samweli. Nambu Samweli akajova, “Mwenuyu ahaguliwi lepi na Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese akamujovela Shama apita palongoloya Samweli. Nambu Samweli akamjovela, “Mwenuyu mewa ahaguliwi lepi na Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese avapitisi vana vaki voha saba palongolo ya Samweli, nambu Samweli akamujovela, “Bambu Chapanga amuhagwili lepi mundu yoyoha pagati ya hava.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Penapo Samweli akamukota Yese, “Wu, vana vagosi veuvi navu ndi ava ndu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese akayangula, “Pehe! Akona mmonga mdebe kuliku voha, nambu ahambili kudima mambelele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samweli akamujovela, “Mtuma mundu akamkemelayi, tete yati titama lepi pahi amala kulya mbaka abwela mwenuyo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Penapo Yese akamutuma mundu, na mwene akabwela nayu. Musongolo mwenuyo avili mdung'u, mihu gaki gavili gabwina, na mbwina. Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Samweli, “Mwenuyu ndi mwenimuhagwili, hamba kamuyitilila mahuta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samweli akatola Kag'elu kekanamahuta akamyitalila Daudi mahuta, kuni vahaja va Daudi vilola. Bahopo mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukamubwelela Daudi cha makakala na kutama nayu kuhumila ligono lenilo na kuyendelela. Kangi Samweli akakiliwuka ku Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akumuhengela Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Penapo Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukamuleka Sauli, na mpungu uhakahu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga ukamuyingila na kumung'aha Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Vahengaji vaki Sauli vakamjovela, “Timanyili kuvya mpungu uhakau kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga ndi weukung'aha. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Hinu wa bambu witu, tilagisayi tete tavatumisi vaku vetikuhengela tihamba tikakulondelayi mundu mweamanyili kutova bwina kanjeke, ndava peukubwelelayi mpungu uhakahu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga ndi yati itova kanjeke na veve yati uvya bwina.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli akavajovela vahengaji vaki, “Munilondelayi mundu mwenuyo mweihotola kutova bwina kanjeke na muniletelayi apa.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Mtumisi waki mmonga akamjovela, “Nimuwene msongolo mmonga mwana wa Yese mweitama ku muji wa Betelehemu. Msongolo mwenuyo amanyili kutova bwina kanjeke. Mwenuyo avii ngangali na mkekesi wa ngondo, ilongela kwa luhala na anyambili. Na Bambu Chapanga avii pamonga nayu.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Hinu Sauli akatuma vandu kwa Yese na kujova, “Niletelayi mwana waku Daudi mweidima mambelele.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese ampeliki Daudi kwa Sauli, pamonga na lipunda leligegili mabumunda na kahaku ka divayi na kamene kadebe. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi akahika kwa Sauli na kutumbula lihengu laki. Sauli akamugana neju Daudi, na akamukita avya wa kumugegela vindu vyaki vya ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Kangi Sauli akatuma kavili vajumbi kwa Yese akamujovela, “Niganiswi na Daudi, mulekayi ayendelelayi kutama na nene anihengelayi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Kila lukumbi mpungu uhakahu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga pewamuyingilayi Sauli ndi Daudi atolayi kanjeke na kutumbula kutova, ndi mpungu wenuwo wamulekayi Sauli, na mwene Sauli avya bwina na kusangaluka.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliati akuvavevesa Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo Vafilisiti vakakonganeka pamonga ku Soko, muji weuvili mu Yuda, ndava ya ngondo. Vakavika kambi pandu pepikemiwa Efesi Damimu pepavii pagati ya Soko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli pamonga na Vaisilaeli vakakonganeka pamonga na kuvika kambi paligema lelikemiwa Ela. Vakajitendekeha kutovana na Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Vafilisiti vakayima pa chitumbi chingi na Vaisilaeli vakayima pa chitumbi chingi, pagati yavi kwavili na ligema.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Mu kambi ya Vafilisiti ahumalili mkekesi mmonga mweikemiwa Goliati, mweahumali ku muji wa Gati. Avili na utali wa mita hidatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Kumutu awalili kofiya ya shaba na panganga awalili ligwanda la shaba lelina kilo amusini na saba. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Mumagendelu gaki awalili vindu ngati mabeketu ga shaba ga kumudivalila, na mumavega gaki agegili mgoha wa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Chaka cha mgoha wenuwo chavili ngati chibingili cha mundu mweitota nyula, na mutu wa mgoha wenuwo wavili na kilo saba. Chingwamba chaki agegili mundu yungi mweamlongolili palongolo yaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliati akayima na kuvakwesela lwami manjolinjoli va Isilaeli, na kujova, “Ndava kyani mujitendekihi ndava ya kutovana ngondo? Nene Namfilisiti, na nyenye mwavandu va Sauli. Muhagulayi mundu mmonga pagati yinu abwelayi kutovana na nene. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Akanitovayi na kunikoma, tete yati tivya tavavanda vinu. Nambu nikamtovayi na kumukoma, penapo nyenye yati muvya mwavavanda vitu na kutihengela.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Mufilisiti yula akajova kangi cha mahanyi, “Lelu iyi nikuvaliga manjolinjoli va Isilaeli, munipela mundu mmonga abwela kutovana na nene.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli pamonga na manjolinjoli voha va Isilaeli pevagayuwini malovi ga Mufilisiti mwenuyo, vakandendemeka na kuyogopa neju.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi pa kambi ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi avili mwana wa Yese, wa lukolo lwa Efulaimu kuhuma ku Betelehemu mu mlima wa Yuda. Yese avili na vana vagosi nane. Lukumbi Sauli peavii nkosi, Yese avii mgogolo neju. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Vana vadatu vavaha va Yese, Eliabu mvelekanu wa kutumbula na Abinadabu ndi mwealandili na Shama ndi wadatu, venavo vahambili ku ngondo pamonga na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi avili mwana wa mwisu kuvelekewa, vala vadatu va kutumbula vahambili pamonga na Sauli ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Nambu Daudi ahambayi kwa Sauli na kuwuya ku Betelehemu kudima mambelele ga dadi waki.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa magono alubaini lukela na chimihi Goliati ayimayi palongolo na kuvakitila luhonda manjolinjoli va Isilaeli kugana vawusa mundu wa kutovana na mwene.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Ligono limonga Yese akamujovela Daudi mwana waki, “Vapelekelayi vahaja vaku mandulutulu kilo kumi na mabumunda kumi. Vapelekelayi ku kambi yavi. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Tolayi na hipandi kumi ya mahuta ga mavele gegagandili umupelekelayi mkulu wa manjolinjoli, ukavalolayi vahaja vaku ngati viyendelela bwina, kangi uwuyayi ubwela unijovelayi cheviyendelela. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Nkosi Sauli na vahaja vaku pamonga na manjolinjoli voha va Isilaeli, vavii ku ligema lelikemiwa Ela, vitovana ngondo na Vafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Chilau yaki, Daudi ayumwiki lukela pee, mambelele akamulekela mudimaji. Akatola chakulya na kuhamba ngati chealagizwi na Yese dadi waki. Peahikili pa kambi ya Vaisilaeli, avakolili vihamba pandu pavi pa ngondo kuni viwusa lwami lwa ngondo.<verse eid="1SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Manjolinjoli ga Vaisilaeli na ga Vafilisiti vahambayi mu misitali yavi kuni vilolesana. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi akatola vindu vyeagegili vila na kumulekela mundu mweiyangalila mizigu, akajumba akahamba ku msitali wa Vaisilaeli, na kuvajambusa valongo vaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Pealongelayi navu, yula Goliati, Mfilisiti mkekesi kuhuma ku Gati, akamwangila palongolo ya msitali wa manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti na kuwusa malovi ga kuvaliga ngati cheayovalili. Na mwene Daudi akamyuwanila bwina. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Vaisilaeli pevamuwene Goliati, voha vakamtila na kumuyogopa neju. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Vaisilaeli vakajovesana, “Wu, mumuweni mundu uyu cheiyendelela kumwangila lukumbi lwoha? Chakaka amwangalili muni avaliga Vaisilaeli. Nkosi Sauli ijova kuvya yati akumpela vindu vyamahele mundu yoyoha mweakumukomayi mundu mwenuyu. Mewa yati akumugegesa msikana waki, na lukolo lwaki yati vilipa lepi kodi pa mlima wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi akavakota vandu vevayimili papipi yaki, “Wu, mundu mweakumukomayi Mufilisiti mwenuyu na kuvawusila Vaisilaeli soni iyi, yati ikitiwa kyani? Mufilisiti mwenuyu mweangadumuliwa jandu ndi yani, hati avaliga manjolinjoli va Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Vandu vakamjovela Daudi galagala gevamjovili pakutumbula kumuvala mundu mweakumukoma Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Eliabu muhaja muvaha wa Daudi peayuwini Daudi ilongela na vandu, akamuyomela neju Daudi na kumjovela, “Ndava kyani ubwelili kuni? Wu, mambelele gadebedebe gala umulekili yani kulukongolo kula? Nimanyili chauvi na chinywinda na cheuvi wamuhakahu waku, ubwelili ndu kulola ngondo!”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi akamuyangula, “Hinu nikiti kyani? Wu, nikotoka kukota lijambu loloha?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daudi akamung'anamukila mundu yungi akamkota likotesi lilalila, vandu voha veavakotili vamuyangwili chilachila.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Vandu vangi vevamuyuwini gealongelayi Daudi, vakahamba kumjovela Sauli, na mwene Sauli akalagisa vakamukemela Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi akamujovela Sauli, “Mundu yoyoha akotoka kumuyogopa Mufilisiti mwenuyu! Nene muhengaji waku yati nihamba kutovana nayu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli akamuyangula Daudi, “Veve uhotola lepi kuhamba kutovana na Mfilisiti yula. Veve wakona wa msongolo, mundu mwenuyo atovini ngondo tangiya usongolo waki.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daudi akamuyangula, “Nene mtumisi waku niyovalili kudima mambelele ga dadi wangu. Lukumbi pelihumalila lidubu amala lihimba kubwela kukamula limbelele, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nene nikulijumbisana na kukomana nalu na kulitola limbelele mu mulomo waki. Nambu ngati lidubu amala lihimba likanihanganilayi, nene nikulikamula pa likolomelu, nikuligwiha pahi na kulikoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Nene namtumisi waku nimalili kukoma lidubu na lihimba. Hinu hati Mfilisiti mwenuyo mweangadumuliwa jandu, mweakuvaliga manjolinjoli va Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, yati ivya ngati venavo. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Bambu Chapanga mweanisangwili kuhuma mu yugu za madubu na mahimba, mewawa yati akunisangula kuwuka mu mawoko ga Mfilisiti mwenuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sauli akamujovela. “Hambayi, Bambu Chapanga avyayi pamonga na veve.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli akamuwalika Daudi nyula zaki za ngondo, akamuwalika kofiya yaki ya shaba kumutu na kakoti kaki ka shaba ka kujidivalila panganga. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi akajikunga upanga wa Sauli mu chiwunu chaki, akalinga kugenda nambu ahotwili lepi muni ayovalili lepi kuwala nyula ngati zenizo. Akamujovela Sauli, “Nihotola lepi kuhamba ku ngondo kuni niwalili nyula ngati izi, muni nene niziyovalili lepi.” Ndi akazihula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi akatola ndonga yaki mu chiwoko, akahagula maganga muhanu gabwina kuhuma mu kapela, akagasopa mukahaku kaki ka kudimila. Na chiwoko chaki chingi akamwili ngumbewa yaki, akatumbula kumuhambila Goliati Mfilisiti yula.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akumukoma Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mufilisiti yula na mwene akatumbula kumuhegelela Daudi, kuni amulongwisi yula mweamugegili chingwamba chaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mufilisiti peamulingulili bwina Daudi na kumuwona msongolo ndu, mdung'u na mweanyambili, ndi akamuvevesa. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati akamkota Daudi, “Hinu ndonga yeniyo ndi ya kyani? Ubwela na ndonga uholalela nene nalibwa?” Goliati yula akatumbula kuhikemela michapanga yaki muni imukitila gahakahu Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Goliati akamujovela Daudi, “Bwela kuni! Higa yaku yati nikuhipela hidege na hinyama ya kudasi valyayi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Daudi akamuyangula Goliati, “Veve ukunibwelela nene na upanga na mugoha na nduta. Nambu nene nikukubwelela veve kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa manjolinjoli ga Isilaeli, mweumuligili. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Lelu Bambu Chapanga yati akunikita nikutovayi. Na nene yati nikukutova na kudumula mutu waku. Na higa za manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti yati nikuhipela hidege na hinyama ya kudasi valyayi. Na mulima woha yati umanya kuvya avili Chapanga pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Vandu voha vevakonganiki apa lelu, yati vimanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga avasangula lepi vandu kwa migoha amala upanga. Ngondo yeniyi ndi ya Bambu Chapanga, na mwene yati akutikita tivahotola nyenye Mwavafilisiti mwavoha.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati akatumbula kavili kumuhambila Daudi, Daudi na mwene akajumba kuhamba peavii Goliati muni atovana nayu. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Pena Daudi akayingisa chiwoko chaki mu kahaku kaki, akatola liganga limonga akalivika mu ngumbewa na kumtova Goliati pa chiwungi. Liganga likayingila mbaka mugati. Goliati akagwa pahi cha kukupama. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Chenicho ndi Daudi cheamuhotwili Goliati kwa ngumbewa yaki na liganga changali kuvya na upanga mu chiwoko chaki. Amtovili Mfilisiti yula na kumkoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Kangi Daudi akajumba, akahamba kuyima panani ya higa ya Goliati, akauholomola upanga mu hala ya Goliati, na kududumula hingu ya Goliati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Vafilisiti pevaweni mkekesi wavi wa ngondo akomiwi chenicho, vakatila. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Penapo vandu va ku Isilaeli na va ku Yuda vakayima kuhamba kulongolo kuni viywanga kwa lwami, na kuvajumbisana Vafilisiti mbaka uko ku Gati, pa Limlyangu ya Ekiloni. Higa za Vafilisiti vevakomiwi zadandasiki mumihana ya njila yeyihumalila ku Shaalaimu mbaka ku Gati na ku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Vaisilaeli pevawuyili kuhuma kuvavingisana Vafilisiti, vakatola kila chindu chechavii pa kambi ya Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi akautola mutu wa Goliati na kuupeleka ku Yelusalemu. Nambu vindu vya ngondo vya Goliati akavivika mu lindanda laki mwene Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ipelekwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli peaweni Daudi ihamba kukomana na Goliati, akamukota Abuneli, mkekesi wa ngondo, “Abuneli, msongolo mwenuyu ndi mwana wa yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abuneli akayangula, “Nilapa kwaku veve nkosi mweuvii mumi, chakaka nene nimmanyili lepi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Nkosi Sauli akamjovela, “Hamba kakotakesayi, msongolo mwenuyu ndi mwana wa yani.” <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Daudi peawuyili ndu kuhuma kumukoma Goliati, Abuneli akamutola na kumupeleka kwa Sauli, kuni Daudi akona akamwili mutu wa Goliati mu mawoko gaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli akamukota Daudi, “Wa msongolo veve ndi wamwana wa yani?” Daudi akamyangula, “Nene namwana wa mtumisi waku Yese, kuhuma ku muji wa Betelehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Daudi peamalili kulongela na Sauli, Yonatani mwana wa Sauli, aganiswi neju na Daudi, amganili kwa mtima waki woha ngati cheakujigana mwene. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Tangiya ligono lenilo Sauli akamtola Daudi atama ku nyumba yaki na amlekili lepi awuya ku nyumba ya dadi waki. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yonatani avikili lilaganu na Daudi muni amuganili ngati cheakujigana mwene. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonatani akahula kanzu yeawalili akamupela Daudi pamonga na nyula za kuwala ku ngondo, vindu vyaki vya ngondo, hati pamonga na upanga na upindi na nduta na mkungi waki. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Kila pandu Sauli peamtumili Daudi, avahotwili vamakoko vaki. Ndava yeniyo Sauli akamukita Daudi avya mkulu wa manjolinjoli vaki. Lijambu lenilo lavaganisi vandu voha pamonga na vatumisi va Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akumuwonela wihu Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Manjolinjoli pevawuyayi ku nyumba kuni valongosini na Daudi mweamukomili Mfilisiti yula, vadala kuhuma mu kila muji wa pa Isilaeli vakahamba kumpokela nkosi Sauli. Vadala venavo vakavya viyimba nyimbu kwa kusangaluka, kuni vitova kanjeke na hitolilu. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Mewa vakinayi na kuyimba nyimbu za kuyidakilana ngati naha, “Sauli akomili vandu elufu, na Daudi akomili vandu makumi elufu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli aganiswi lepi na malovi ga lunyimbu lwenulo, akayoma neju. Akajova, “Vamupelili Daudi vandu makumi elufu, nambu nene vanipelili vandu maelufu ndu. Chechisigalili ndi kumukita Daudi avya nkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Tangiya ligono lenilo Sauli amuwonela wihu Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Chilau yaki, mpungu uhakahu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga ukamuyingila Sauli chimakakala, balapala akavya ngati ipenga na akatumbula kuywanga ywanga mu nyumba yaki, lukumbi lwenulwo Daudi atovayi kanjeke ngati cheayovalili. Sauli akamwili mgoha mu chiwoko chaki. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Chigafula Sauli amujugumili Daudi mgoha wenuwo mala zivili, muni ajijovili mu mtima waki kuvya, “Yati nikumuhoma Daudi mgoha na kumukita asigalila bahopo pa luwumba.” Nambu Daudi ayepili mala zivili zoha. <verse eid="1SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli akamuyogopa Daudi, muni Bambu Chapanga avili pamonga na Daudi, nambu amlekili Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ndava yeniyo Sauli akamuwusa Daudi palongolo yaki na kumkita avya chilongosi wa manjolinjoli elufu yimonga. Na mwene Daudi akavalongosa bwina manjolinjoli venavo ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Kila chindu cheakitili Daudi, achikitili bwina, muni Bambu Chapanga avili pamonga nayu. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli peaweni kuvya Daudi ihotola ngondo kila lukumbi, ndi akamuyogopa neju. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Nambu vandu voha va Isilaeli na Yuda vakamugana Daudi, muni avalongwisi bwina ku ngondo.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akumgega msikana wa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli akamujovela Daudi, “Mwenuyu ndi Melabu msikana wangu mvaha, yati nikugegesa avya mdala waku ngati ukakita malaganu aga, uvya linjolinjoli wangu mkekesi na mweukita genigana, utovana ngondo zezikumuvala Bambu Chapanga.” Sauli akitili chenicho muni aholalili mu mtima waki kuvya aganili lepi kumkoma Daudi kwa chiwoko chaki, leka akakomiwa na Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi akamujovela Sauli, “Nene nayani mbaka nivyayi namkohanu wa nkosi? Lukolo lwangu na hati vandu va munyumba ya dadi wangu vimanyikana lepi pa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Pelwahikili lukumbi lwa Sauli kumuwusa Melabu msikana waki agegewayi na Daudi, Sauli amugegisi kwa mundu yungi mweakemiwi Adilieli mweahumili ku muji wa Mehola. <verse eid="1SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Nambu Mikali msikana yungi wa Sauli amuganayi Daudi, Sauli peayuwini genago, akahekalela neju. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli akaholalela, “Linda nimugegese mwenuyu muni avya lingongeka laki, ndi Vafilisiti yati vakumukoma.” Ndi Sauli akamujovela kavili Daudi, “Hinu wivya wamkohanu wangu kavili.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Penapo Sauli akavalagisa vatumisi vaki naha, “Mulongelayi na Daudi pachiyepela mumjovela, ‘Nkosi pamonga na vahengaji vaki voha vaganiswi neju na veve, hinu yidakilayi kumugega msikana waki.’” <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Vatumisi va Sauli vala vamujovili malovi genago Daudi chi mfiyu na mwene akayangula, “Nene ninavindu lepi vyamahele na namungangu ndu, wu mwiholalela kuvya lijambu lidebe nene nivya mkohanu wa nkosi Sauli?” <verse eid="1SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Vatumisi vala vakakiliwuka kwa sauli na kumkokosela geajovii Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli akavajovela, “Mumjovelayi Daudi naha, ‘Nkosi igana lepi uwusa chindu chochoha ndava ya kumgega msikana waki, nambu igana ndu umpelekelayi hikumba ya njocholo miya yimonga ya Vafilisiti muni alipisa gala gevakitili Vafilisiti vamakoko vaki.’” Chenichi ndi Sauli cheaganili Daudi akomiwa na Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Vatumisi vala pevamukokosili Daudi gala geigana Sauli, Daudi ahekalili neju muni nkosi yati ivya mkohanu waki. Hinu kwakona langahika ligono la kuleta mali, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daudi akawuka kuhamba pamonga na vandu vaki, akavakoma Vafilisiti miya zivili. Akavadumulana hikumba ya njocholo zavi na kuhipeleka kwa nkosi Sauli, Daudi akahivalanga hikumba yoha palongolo ya nkosi, muni amugega msikana wa nkosi. Penapo Sauli akamugegesa Daudi msikana waki mweikemiwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Nambu Sauli peamanyili kuvya Bambu Chapanga avii pamonga na Daudi, na Mikali amuganili neju Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli ayendalili kamuyogopa Daudi, magono goha Sauli asigalili kuvya likoko wa Daudi mu wumi waki woha. <verse eid="1SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Vachilongosi va manjolinjoli vakekesi va Vafilisiti vakayendelela kutovana ngondo na Vaisilaeli, nambu pevayendelelayi kutovana, Daudi akavahotola neju kuliku vakekesi vangi va ngondo va Sauli. Penapo liina la Daudi likamanyikana neju.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli igana kumukoma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli akamjovela Yonatani mwana waki pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki vakekesi voha vamkoma Daudi. Nambu Yonatani mwana wa Sauli amuganili neju Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Hinu Yonatani akamujovela Daudi, “Dadi wangu ilonda njila ya kukukoma. Hinu ujiyangalilayi, chilau lukela hamba pandu pala pa kujihiha na usigalila kukwokwo. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nene yati nibwela na dadi wangu ku mgunda kweujihihili. Penapo yati nilongela nayu kukuvala veve, na lijambu loloha lenikulimanya, yati nibwela kukujovela.” <verse eid="1SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonatani akamulumbalila Daudi palongolo ya Sauli dadi waki, akamujovela, “Nkosi kotoka kukita chindu chochoha chihakahu kwa muhengaji waku Daudi. Muni mwene akukitili lepi lijambu lihakahu loloha, goha geakukitili ndi gakukutangatila neju veve. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Wumi waki auweni kuvya chindu lepi pala peamukomayi Goliati, Mufilisiti yula, ndi mwene Bambu Chapanga avapelili Vaisilaeli uhotola uvaha. Veve pewaweni chenicho mewa wahekalili neju. Ndava kyani ugana kukita uhakahu kwa kumkoma Daudi changali kujova cheahokili?” <verse eid="1SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli akamuyuwanila Yonatani na kulapa naha, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi yati nikumukoma lepi Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Penapo Yonatani akamukemela Daudi na kumukokosela goha gevalongili na Sauli. Yonatani akamupeleka Daudi kwa Sauli, Daudi akamuhengela Sauli ngati cheyavi pa kutumbula. <verse eid="1SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Pegamaliki genago pakahumalili ngondo kavili pagati ya Vafilisiti na Vaisilaeli. Daudi akahamba kutovana na Vafilisiti, akavakoma Vafilisiti vamahele na vevasigalili vakamtila. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Mpungu uhakahu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga ukamuyingila Sauli peavili ku nyumba yaki, kuni akamwili mgoha mu chiwoko chaki, lukumbi lwenulwo Daudi atovayi kanjeke kaki. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli alingili kumukoma Daudi na mgoha wenuwo cha kumuhindalila mu luwumba. Daudi akayepa na mgoha wenuwo ukahoma mu luwumba. Kilu yiyoyo Daudi akawuka na akatoloka penapo. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Kilu yiyo Sauli akavatuma vandu ku nyumba ya Daudi vakamulolayi ngati avili na yikahika lukela amukomayi. Nambu Mikali mdala wa Daudi akamujovela Daudi, “Ngati yati utila lepi kusangula wumi waku kilu iyi, chilau lukela yati ukomiwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Penapo Mikali akamtangatila Daudi kumuhelesa pa lidilisha kuhumila kunani mbaka pahi, ndi Daudi akatila. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Penapo Mikali akatola chimong'omong'o na kuchigoneka pa chitanda na ku mutu akachiyegemesela msagamilu wa mangoma ga mene, na akachigubika nyula. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli peatumili vandu vakamukamulayi Daudi, Mikali akavajovela, “Daudi ilwala.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Kangi Sauli akavatuma vahamba kavili, akavalagisa akajova, “Mumuleta Daudi hati ngati avii pa chitanda chaki nimkoma.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Vandu vala pevayingili pandu peagonili Daudi na kugubukula kumbi vagoniki chimong'omong'o na kumutu vavikili msagamilu wa mangoma ga mene. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sauli akamujovela Mikali, “Ndava kyani unikongili naha? Umulekili likoko wangu atolokayi?” Mikali akamuyangula Sauli, “Anijovili, ‘Nileka nihamba ngati lepi yati nikukoma.’” <verse eid="1SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Hinu Daudi atilili, na ajumbalili kwa Samweli ku Lama na akamujovela goha geakitiwi na Sauli. Pena Daudi na Samweli vakahamba kutama ku Nayoti. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Badayi Sauli akayuwana kuvya Daudi avii ku Nayoti ku muji wa Lama, <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Hinu Sauli akatuma vandu vakamukamulayi Daudi. Nambu pevaukolili msambi wa vamulota weulongoswa na Samweli viwusa ulota, Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukavayingila vatumisi va Sauli vala na vene balapala vakatumbula kuwusa ulota. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli peajoviwi mambu genago, akavatuma vahengaji vangi, na vene mewa vakatumbula kuwusa ulota. Sauli akatuma vangi mala ya datu, na vene mewa vakawusa ulota. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Penapo akahamba mwene ku Lama. Peahikili pa chiliva chivaha chechivili ku Seku, akamukolela mundu mmonga na akamukota, “Samweli na Daudi vavili kwoki?” Mundu mwenuyo akamuyangula, “Vavii ku Nayoti ku muji wa Lama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Na mwene Sauli akahamba ku Nayoti ku muji Lama, peahikili kwenuko, Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukamuyingila na mwene akatumbula kuwusa ulota kuni avii mu njila mbaka peahikili ku Nayoti ku muji wa Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Akahula nyula zaki na kuwusa ulota palongolo ya Samweli, akatama waka ligono lenilo loha muhi na kilu. Chenichi ndi chechavakitili vandu vakotana, “Wu, Sauli mewa ndi mmonga wa vamlota?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonatani akumtangatila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Penapo Daudi akatila kuhuma ku Nayoti ku muji wa Lama mbaka kwa Yonatani na kumukota, “Wu, nikitili kyani? Kyani chenibudili? Wu, nimuhokili kyani dadi waku mbaka igana kunikoma?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonatani akamuyangula, “Pehe, yati ufwa lepi! Chakaka dadi wangu ikita lepi chindu chochoha chikavya chivaha amala chidebe changali kunijovela nene. Ihotola lepi kunihiha chochoha, yivii lepi ngati cheuholalela!”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Nambu Daudi alapili na kujova, “Dadi waku amanyili bwina njwee veve cheuniganili, na iholalela kukuhiha cheigana kukita muni akakitaya veve ukotoka kuvya ngolongondi. Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi na kwa veve, kufwa kwangu kuvii papipi!”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonatani akamujovela Daudi, “Chochoha cheugana nikuhengelayi yati nikuchihenga.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daudi akamujovela Yonatani, “Chilau ndi mselebuko wa kuvandama kwa mwehi, na nene niganikiwa nikalyayi pamonga na nkosi. Nambu leka nikajihihe ku mgunda mbaka pamalau chimihi. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Dadi waku akawonayi kuvya nene nivii lepi na akanikotakesayi, umujovelayi, ‘Daudi aniyupili neju nimleka ahamba ku muji wavi ku Betelehemu, kuhamba kuwusa teta ya kutinyiswa ya mwaka pamonga na valongo vaki ngati chevikita miyaka yoha.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Dadi waku akajovayi, ‘Akiti chabwina.’ Ndi umanya kuvya iholalela lepi kunikoma, nambu ngati ayomili ndi umanyayi kuvya iholalela kunikoma. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Chondi unikitila bwina nene namuhengaji waku ndava muni veve wakitili lilaganu na nene palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Nambu ngati nibudili unikomayi wamwene, ndava kyani unipeleka kwa dadi waku anikomayi?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonatani akamuyangula, “Kotoka kuholalela genaga! Nikujovela chakaka, nganimanyayi hati lijambu lidebe kuvya dadi wangu iholalela gahakahu ndava yaku nganikujovili.”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Kangi Daudi akamukota, “Yati nimanya wuli ngati dadi waku akuyangwili cha kukulakalila?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonatani akamuyangula, “Tiye ku mugunda.” Ndi vakahamba pamonga ku mgunda. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonatani akamujovela Daudi, “Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli avya shahidi witu! Chilau amala pamalau lukumbi ngati ulu yati nikumukota dadi wangu na yati nikujovela ngati ana kyani na veve, akajova mambu gaku bwina, nene yati nikumtuma mundu abwela kukujovela. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Nambu ngati dadi wangu iholalela kukukoma na nene nikujovili lepi na veve utilalila kutali muni uvya mumi, Bambu Chapanga anibunayi neju ngati yati nikujovela lepi kuvya Sauli igana kukukoma. Bambu Chapanga avyayi pamonga na veve ngati cheavi pamonga na dadi wangu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Nikayendelelayi kuvya mumi unilangisa ubwina wangamalika ngati wula wa Bambu Chapanga muni nikoto kufwa. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Nambu veve hinu uyendelela kulangisa ubwina waku wangamalika kwa vandu va mu nyumba yangu. Hati lukumbi lula Bambu Chapanga peakuvakomakesa vamakoko vaku vevavii pa mulima.” <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ndi Yonatani akavika lilaganu na vandu va mu nyumba ya Daudi kujova, “Bambu Chapanga avakomakesa vamakoko va Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Na mwene Yonatani akagana Daudi alapa kavili kuvya yati iyendelela kumgana, muni Yonatani amuganili Daudi ngati cheakujigana mwene. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Penapo Yonatani akamujovela kavili Daudi, “Ndava chilau ndi mselebuko wa kuvandama mwehi na vandu yati vakukuwona lepi ndava muni chigoda chaku yati chivya waka. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Pamalau kimihi, hamba ukajihihayi pandu pala pewajihihili ligono pelatumbukanayi lijambu lenili, ukalindilayi kuyetu ya liganga lelikemiwa Ezeli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nene yati nijugumila nduta zidatu pamuhana ya liganga lenilo ngati nilunga chindu. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Kangi yati nikumutuma msongolo na kumujovela, ‘Hamba kailonda nduta zenizo.’ Ngati nikamujovela, ‘Lola nduta zivii upandi waku, uhileta apa.’ Wenuwo ndi ulangisu wa kukulangisa kuvya uvii mumi, na veve yati umwangila pandu pepavi waka, muni nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavi mumi kuvya yati ukomiwa lepi. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Nambu nikamujovelayi, ‘Lola nduta zivii palongolo yaku.’ Penapo wuka, muni Bambu Chapanga yati igana utila. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Ndava ya malaganu getivikilini, Bambu Chapanga ndi shahidi witu pagati ya nene na veve magono goha gangali na mwisu.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Penapo Daudi akajihiha ku mgunda. Lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa kuvandama kwa mwehi pelwahikili, nkosi Sauli akatama kulya chakulya. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Nkosi Sauli akatama pa chigoda chaki chechayegemili mu luwumba ngati cheitamaga. Yonatani akatama pamuhana ya nkosi na Abuneli akatama papipi na nkosi. Nambu pa chigoda cha Daudi chikavya waka. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Ligono lenilo nkosi Sauli alongili lepi chochoha, muni aholalili kuvya, “Pangi kuna chindu chimuhumalili Daudi, chechimkiti avya mweangayidakiliwa kubwela pa mselebuko uwu.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Ligono lelalandili la mselebuko wa kuvandama kwa mwehi, chigoda cha Daudi chavii chakona waka. Sauli akamukota Yonatani mwana waki, “Ndava kyani Daudi mwana wa Yese abwelili lepi kulya chakulya jana na lelu?” <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatani akamuyangula, “Daudi aniyupili neju nimuleka ahamba ku Betelehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Anijovili kuvya, ‘Nileka nihamba muni vandu va mu nyumba yangu viwusa teta ya kutinyiswa ku Betelehemu, na muhaja wangu anijovili nihambayi kwenuko. Ndava muni niganikiwa nihamba, niyupa uniyidakila nihambayi kwa valongo vangu.’ Chenichi ndi chechimkitili akotoka kubwela kulya chakulya na veve nkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Penapo Sauli akamuyomela neju Yonatani na kumujovela, “Veve wa mwana mgosi uvi ngati nyina waku mweangayidakila malagizu na mweangaganikiwa kwa chochoha! Nimanyili kuvya uvii upandi wa Daudi mwana wa Yese na ukujipela soni wamwene na umpela soni mewa nyina waku mweakuveliki! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Umanyili lepi kuvya ngati Daudi ivya mumi veve yati upata lepi fwasi ya kuvya nkosi wa mulima uwu? Hinu hamba ukamuleta pe apa nimkomayi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonatani akamkota dadi waki, “Ndava ya kyani akomiwayi? Akitili uhakahu woki?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Penapo Sauli akamujugumila Yonatani mgoha muni amukomayi. Ndi Yonatani akamanya kuvya chakaka dadi waki igana kumukoma Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Penapo Yonatani akawuka kanyata pa chakulya kuni ana ligoga neju. Ligono lelalandili la kumalakisa mselebuko wa kuvandama mwehi alili lepi chakulya chochoha. Yonatani aviniswi neju mu mtima ndava ya mambu ga soni geakitili dadi waki kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Chilau yaki lukela Yonatani akahamba ku mgunda kula kukonganeka na Daudi ngati chevalagini. Alongosini na kasongolo kadebedebe. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Pevahikili kwenuko, Yonatani akamjovela msongolo yula, “Jumba kalonda nduta zenikuzijugumila.” Msongolo peajumbayi ndi Yonatani akajugumila nduta zampitayi msongolo yula na kutula palogolo yaki. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Msolngolo peahikili pandu pezagwilalili nduta, Yonatani akamkemela na kumjovela, “Hamba palongolo, nduta zivii palongolo yaku? <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Kita kanyata uhamba ukotoka kuyima pandu penapo.” Msongolo yula akanonga nduta na akawuya kwa Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Msongolo mdebe yula amanyili lepi chindu chochoha, nambu vevamanyili ndi Yonatani na Daudi ndu. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonatani akamupela musongolo yula vindu vyaki vya ngondo na kumujovela, “Hamba kiliwuka kubomani.” <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Msongolo yula peawukili, Daudi akahuma pandu peajihihili pala kuyetu ya liganga lila. Daudi akamgundamila Yonatani mala zidatu. Penapo Daudi na Yonatani vakakumbatilana kuni voha vivemba. Daudi ndi mweavembili neju kuliku Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Kangi Yonatani akamujovela Daudi, “Hamba kwa uteke. Muni talapili kuvya tavamkozi kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga, tikajova, ‘Bambu Chapanga ndi shaidi pagati yitu magono goha gangali na mwisu, na pagati ya viveleku vyangu na vyaku magono goha gangali na mwisu.’” Kangi Daudi akawuka na Yonatani akakiliwuka kubomani.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akumtila Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daudi akahamba kwa mteta Ahimeleki uko ku Nobu. Ahimeleki akahamba kumupokela kuni indendemeka, akamukota Daudi, “Ndava kyani uvii wamwene? Na ndava kyani ubwelili lepi na mundu yungi?” <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi akamuyangula, “Nibwelili namwene muni nkosi anitumili nibwela apa kumkitila lijambu nunuyu. Anijovoli katu nikotoka kumukokosela mundu yoyoha pandu penivili na lijambu leniganikiwa kukita. Nilagini na vandu vangu kuvya tikonganeka pandu nunuyu. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Wu, uvii na chakulya chochoha peapa? Nikuyupa unipela mabumunda muhanu amala chochoha cheuvii nachu.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mteta Ahimeleki akamuyangula Daudi, “Apa nivii lepi na mabumunda geugana veve, nambu nivi nagu mabumunda gegawusiwi kwa Bambu Chapanga gegiliwa na vamteta ndu. Nihotola kukupela mabumunda aga ngati ndu vandu vaku vagonikini lepi na vadala vavi.” <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi akamujovela, “Chakaka nene na vandu vangu tigonikini lepi na vadala vitu mu magono aga gadatu, ngati chetikitaga petivya mu lugendu lwa magono goha. Mivili ya vandu vangu yiyidakiliwa mu kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga magono goha petivya mu lugendu, na mu lugendu lwenulu lijambu lenilo ndi liganikiwa neju.” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Penapo mteta Ahimeleki akampela Daudi mabumunda gegawusiwi kwa Chapanga, muni pavili lepi na mabumunda gangi nga gago ndu gegavikiwi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Vakagawusa mabumunda genago na kuvika mabumunda gangi gegahumi pa chihinja lukumbi lulwolwo ligono lila pegawusiwi. <verse eid="1SA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Hinu ligono lenilo pavili na muhengaji mmonga wa Sauli, mweaganikiwa kunyambiswa muni ayidakiliwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, liina laki akemiwa Doegi, mundu wa kuhuma ku Edomu, chilongosi wa vandu vevamdimila Sauli mifwiya yaki. <verse eid="1SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daudi akamukota Ahimeleki, “Wu, una upanga amala mgoha unipelayi? Nene nawukili changali kugega upanga wangu wala chindu chingi chochoha cha ngondo, muni lihengu la nkosi laganikiwi likitika kanyata.” <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Mteta Ahimeleki akamuyangula, “Nivii nawu upanga ula wa Goliati Mufilisiti yula mwewamukomili kuligema lelikemiwa Ela, uvii kuyetu ya kagwanda ka mteta ukungiwi mu chitambala. Ngati ugana kuutola, utolayi muni kawaka upanga wungi peapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Daudi akamujovela, “Ngati kawaka upanga wungi ngati wenuwo, nikuyupa unipelayi wuwowo.” <verse eid="1SA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Hinu ligono lilolo Daudi akawuka, akamtila Sauli, akahamba kwa Akishi nkosi wa ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Vahengaji va nkosi vakamujovela Akishi, “Mwenuyu Daudi lepi nkosi wa mulima wa Isilaeli? Mwenuyu ndi mwevamuyimbili lunyimbu mung'oma zavi ndava yaki kujova, ‘Sauli akomili vandu vaki maelufu na Daudi akomili vandu vaki makumi elufu.’ ” <verse eid="1SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi agavikili malovi genago mu mtima, na akamuyogopa neju Akishi nkosi wa ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ndava yeniyo Daudi akajikita awonekana ngati mundu mweipenga palongolo yavi, pevaganayi kumkamula, mwene akakwendakwenda luwumba na kuvika alama munani ya mulyangu na kuleka mata gamuhelelayi mu manjwemba gaki. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Mlola! Mundu mwenuyu ipenga! Ndava kyani mumuletili kwa nene? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Wu, nene nigana mundu yungi mweavii na lupengu akita mambu genaga palongolo yang? Nigana lepi mundu mwenuyu ayingila mu nyumba yangu.”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli akuvakoma vamteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi akatoloka kwenuko ku Gati na kutilalila ku mbugu papipi na muji wa Adulamu. Vahaja vaki na valongo vaki vangi pevayuwini kuvya avili penapo, voha vakahamba kwenuko kumlola. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Vandu voha vevang'aikayi amala vevavii na madeni amala vala vevavi na mvinisu mu mtima, vakavya pamonga na Daudi. Vandu voha venavo vavii miya mcheche, na mwene Daudi akavya chilongosi wavi. <verse eid="1SA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kuhuma kwenuko Daudi akahamba mbaka ku Mizipa ku mlima wa Moabu. Akamujovela nkosi wa pa Moabu, “Chondi nikuyupa, dadi wangu na nyina wangu vabwela kutama na veve mbaka penimanyayi Chapanga yati akunikitila kyani.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Hinu Daudi akahamba kuvatola vandu va mu nyumba yaki waki vatama na nkosi wa pa Moabu, na vene vakatama penapo lukumbi lwoha Daudi peajihihili ku mbugu. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Penapo mlota Gadi akamujovela Daudi, “Kotoka kutama mu mbugu, wuka kanyata hamba ku mulima wa Yuda.” Hinu Daudi akawuka akahamba ku dasi yeyikemiwa Heleti. <verse eid="1SA 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Sauli ayuwini kuvya Daudi na vandu vaki vawonikini. Lukumbi lwenulwo Sauli avii ku Gibea, atamili ku chitumbi pahi ya chikongo chechikemiwa mkwaju, mu mawoko gaki akamwili mugoha kuni vatumisi vaki vamtindili. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sauli akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Hinu muniyuwanilayi nyenye mwavandu va likabila la Benjamini, wu, mwiholalela uyu Daudi mwana wa Yese yati akumpela kila mmonga winu migunda ya mizabibu na migunda hingi? Amala wu, mwiholalela yati akuvakita mwavoha muvya mwavachilongosi va msambi wa manjolinjoli elufu na vachilongosi va manjolinjoli miya? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Wu, chenichi ndi chechikuvakita nyenye mkita mpangu wa kuniwusa mu unkosi? Kawaka hati mmonga winu mweanijovili ndali mwana wangu akitili lilaganu na mwana wa Yese. Mewa kawaka hati mundu mmonga pagati yinu mweiviniswa mu mtima ndava yangu amala kunijovela kuvya mwana wangu ndi mweakumkulukisa mtumisi wangu Daudi aninyemelelayi ndava ya kunikoma, ngati chaikita lelu?” <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Penapo Doegi wa likabila la Edomu, mweayimai papipi na vachilongosi va manjolinjoli va Sauli, akajova, “Namuweni Daudi mwana wa Yese ibwela ku Nobu kwa mteta Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Mteta Ahimeleki akamkota Bambu Chapanga ndava ya Daudi, akampela chakulya, mewa akampela na upanga wa Goliati Mufilisiti yula.” <verse eid="1SA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Nkosi Sauli akalagisa vandu vakamkemela mteta Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu pamonga na vandu voha va dadi waki vevavili vamteta ku Nobu. Na vena voha vakabwela kwa nkosi Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli akamjovela Ahimeleki, “Hinu uniyuwanila veve wamwana wa Ahitubu.” Ahimeleki akamuyangula, “Ena, bambu nikuyuwanila.” <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli akamkota, “Ndava kyani veve pamonga na Daudi mwana wa Yese mukitili mpangu wa kuning'anamukila muni muniwusa mu unkosi? Ndava kyani wamupelili mabumunda pamonga na upanga mewa ukamuyupila kwa Chapanga? Ndava yeniyo, aning'anamukili na akuninyemelela anikoma ngati cheikita lelu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki akamuyangula, “Pagati ya vatumisi vaku Daudi ndi chilongosi mweisadikika kuliku voha. Mewa mwenuyu ndi mkohanu waku veve nkosi, mwene ndi chilongosi mkulu wa manjolinjoli gegakuyunga na itopeswa kuliku voha mu nyumba yaku. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Lelu ligono lepi la kutumbula nene kumkota Chapanga ndava yaki. Nkosi kotokayi kuniholalela changaganikiwa nene namtumisi waku pamonga na vandu voha va dadi wangu. Nene nimanyili lepi loloha kuvala mpangu wa kukuwusa mu unkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Nambu nkosi Sauli akamjovela, “Chakaka Ahimeleki veve yati ukomiwa pamonga na vandu voha va mu nyumba ya dadi waku.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Sauli akavajovela valonda vevayimili pamuhana yaki, “Mung'anamukayi muvakomayi va mteta va Bambu Chapanga muni vavii upandi wa Daudi, vamanyili kuvya atitilili nambu vatijovili lepi.” Nambu valonda venavo vanyakwili lepi mawoko gavi kuvakoma vamteta va Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Penapo nkosi Sauli akamlagiza Doegi, akajova, “Ng'anamukayi ukavakomayi vamteta.” Doegi, wa likabila la Edomu akahamba kuvakoma vamteta voha. Ligono lenilo Doegi avakomili vamteta semanini na muhanu veviwala vizibahu vyamsopi vya chimteta panganga. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Mewa akavakoma kwa upanga vandu voha vevatama pa Nobu, muji wa vamteta, pamonga na vagosi na vadala, vana vadebe na vevinyonga na ng'ombi na mapunda na mambelele. <verse eid="1SA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Nambu Abiatali, mwana wa Ahimeleki, mjukulu wa Ahitubu, akapokonyoka akatilalila kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiatali akamkokosela Daudi chila Sauli cheamulagizi Doegi avakoma vamteta va Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ndi Daudi akamujovela Abiatali, “Ligono lila lenamuwene Doegi mundu wa likabila la Edomu peavili penapala, namanyili kuvya yati akumujovela Sauli. Ndava yeniyo nene ndi mwenivayokisi vandu va dadi waku vakomiwayi. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Veve tamayi pamonga na nene kotoka kuyogopa. Mundu mweigana kunikoma nene ndi mweigana kukukoma na veve mewa. Ukatamayi pamonga na nene genago yati gakukolela lepi.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akuvasangula vandu va ku muji wa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Ligono limonga mundu mmonga akamjovela Daudi, “Yuwanila, Vafilisiti vakuutova muji wa Keila na vakuvanyaga mabenu pa luvanja lwa kubulila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Daudi akamukota Bambu Chapanga, “Wu, nihamba nikavatova Vafilisiti ava?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula, “Ena, hamba kavatova Vafilisiti na kuvasangula vandu va muji wa Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Nambu vandu vaki Daudi vakamujovela, “Bahapa pa Yuda pene petitama tiyogopa, wu yati yivya wuli tikahambayi ku Keila kutovana na manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi akamuyupa kavili Bambu Chapanga na mwene Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula, “Helela hambayi ku Keila muni yati nikukukita uvatova Vafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ndi Daudi akahelela akahamba ku Keila pamonga na vandu vaki, kwenuko akavatova Vafilisiti, akavakoma Vafilisiti vamahele na kutola mifwiya yavi. Penapo Daudi akavasangula vandu va pa Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiatali mwana wa Ahimeleki, peatilalili kwa Daudi, ahambili na kakoti ka panganga ka chimteta.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli peajoviwi kuvya Daudi ahambi ku Keila, akajova, “Chapanga akitili chenichi muni nimukamulayi Daudi, ndava ajidindalili mwene kwa kuyingila mu muji weuvi na mamilyangu na madindilu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Penapo Sauli akavakemela manjolinjoli vaki voha ndava ya ngondo, vakahelela kuhamba ku Keila, akamtindila Daudi na vandu vaki.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi peayuwini kuvya Sauli ajitendekihi kumkamula, akamujovela mteta Abiatali, “Niletelayi apa kakoti ako ka chimteta.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Kangi Daudi akayupa, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, nene namtumisi waku niyuwini kuvya Sauli ibwela kuukomakesa muji wa Keila ndava ya nene. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Wu, vandu va pa Keila yati vakumtangatila muni nikamuliwayi? Wu, Sauli yati ibwela ngati nene namuhengaji waku chenayuwini? Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, nikukuyupa uniyangulayi nene namuhengaji waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula, “Sauli yati ibwela.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi akamukota kangi, “Wu, vandu va pa Keila yati vakumtangatila Sauli muni nene pamonga na vandu vangu tikamuliwayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula, “Ena, yati vikita chenicho.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ndi Daudi na vandu vaki vevavii ngati miya sita vakawuka pa Keila na kuhamba kwokwoha kwevahotwili kuhamba. Sauli peayuwini kuvya Daudi amali kutoloka pa Keila, akaleka kuhamba kwenuko.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ku mulima wa hitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Penapo Daudi na vandu vaki vatamili kwa kujihiha mu mulima wa hitumbi, pa lukongolo lwelukemiwa Zifu. Magono goha Sauli amulondayi Daudi, nambu Chapanga amlekili lepi Daudi akamuliwa na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daudi peavili ku Holeshi, ku lukongolo lwelukemiwa Zifu, akamanya kuvya Sauli igana kumukoma. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonatani mwana wa Sauli akamulanda Daudi ku Holeshi na akamkangamalisa mtima kuvya Chapanga iyendelela kumyumnga. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonatani akamujovela Daudi, “Kotoka kuyogopa, dadi wangu Sauli yati akukamula lepi. Veve yati uvya wa nkosi wa Isilaeli na nene yati nivya mtangatila waku, hati dadi wangu Sauli alimanyili lijambu lenilo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Voha vavili vakavikilana lilaganu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Daudi akatama pa muji wa Holeshi na Yonatani akahamba ku nyumba.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Vandu va ku Zifu vakamuhambila Sauli peavii akona ku Gibea, vakamujovela, “Daudi akujihiha pa mulima witu, mu lugangatu lweluvi mu muji wa Holeshi, ku chitumbi chechikemiwa Hakila, chechivii upandi wa kusini mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Hinu veve nkosi, bwelayi ukita chila cheugana mtima waku, na tete lihengu litu yati livya kukutangatila veve umkamula Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli akavayangula, “Chakaka nyenye mukuniwonela nene lipyana, Bambu Chapanga avamotisayi. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Muhamba mukakita umang'omesi muni mpamanya pandu peihambahamba, na yani mweamuweni pandu penapo, ndava niyuwini kuvya Daudi achenjili neju. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Muhamba mkalonda pandi zoha mpamanya kila pandu peakujihiha, kangi muwuya kwa nene na ujumbi weuvii na uchakaka, ndi yati nihamba pamonga na nyenye. Ngati yati ivya pandu penapo, nene yati nikumulonda pagati ya lukolo zoha zezivii pa mulima wa Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Penapo vakawuka na kuhamba ku Zifu, lukumbi lwenulwo Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vavii ku lugangatu lwelukemiwa Maoni ku Alaba mana yaki ligema la mfuleni Yoludani, upandi wa kusini wa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na vandu vaki vakatumbula kumulonda Daudi. Nambu Daudi peajoviwi genago, akahamba kujihiha ku matalau gegavii ku lugangatu lwa Maoni na akatama kwenuko. Sauli peayuwini genago, akamulandalila Daudi mbaka ku lugangatu lwa Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na vandu vaki vakavya vigenda upandi umonga wa chitumbi, na mwene Daudi na vandu vaki vakavya vigenda upandi wungi wa chitumbi chenicho. Daudi na vandu vaki vakiti kanyata kumtoloka Sauli. Lukumbi Sauli na manjolinjoli vaki pevahegalili kumukamula Daudi na vandu vaki, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />akabwela mjumbi kwa Sauli na kumujovela, “Bwela kanyata! Vafilisiti vakuuzangila mulima.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Penapo Sauli akaleka kumlanda Daudi na akahamba kutovana na Vafilisiti. Ndi mana pandu penapo pikemiwa Sela Hamalekoti, mana yaki chitumbi cha malekenganu. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi na vandu vaki vakawuka pandu penapo, vakahamba kujihiha na kutama ku mbugu yeyivii ku chinyepa cha Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akumleka mumi Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli peakiliwiki kuhuma kukukomana na Vafilisiti, akajoviwa kuvya Daudi avii ku lugangatu lwa Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Penapo Sauli akavatola manjolinjoli vaki vakekesi elufu hidatu vevamanyi kutovana ngondo bwina pa Isilaeli, vakahamba kumulonda Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki ku Matalau ga Hipalama. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Sauli peahikili pa mbugu yimonga yeyivii papipi na chivaya cha mambelele, akayingila mu mbugu yeniyo kutunda. Daudi na vandu vaki vavii mugati neju ya mbugu yeniyo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Vandu va Daudi vakamujovela, “Lenili ndi ligono lila Bambu Chapanga peajovili, ‘Yati nikukita uvahotola vamakoko vaku, na veve yati ukuvakitila chewigana wamwene.’” Ndi Daudi akamunyemelela Sauli cha kumgongo na kudumula lugwinyilu lwa nyula yaki. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Daudi akatumbula kuviniswa mu mtima muni adumwili lugwinyilu lwa nyula ya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Daudi akavajovela vandu vaki, “Bambu Chapanga anidivalilayi nikotoka kumukitila lijambu ngati ili bambu wangu mweahaguliwi na kuyitaliwa mahuta muni avya nkosi, nikotoka kumlemasa hati padebe nkosi wangu, muni Bambu Chapanga amuyitalili mahuta avya nkosi!” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa malovi genaga, Daudi avajovili vandu vaki chechikumkita akoto kumkoma Sauli. Penapo Sauli akahuma mu mbugu na kuhamba mu lugendu lwaki. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Badayi Daudi na mwene akahuma kuvala ya mbugu na kumukemela Sauli, “Veve bambu wangu nkosi!” Nkosi Sauli peang'anamwiki kumbele, Daudi akafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi cha utopesa wa nkosi. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daudi akamujovela Sauli, “Ndava kyani ukugayuwanila malovi ga vandu vevakujovela kuvya nene nigana kukukoma? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Lelu ulolili wamwene Bambu Chapanga cheakakusopili mu mawoko gangu peukavili mu mbugu mula. Vandu vangu vanijovili nikukomayi, nambu nene nakulekili mumi. Nikajova, ‘Yati nikumkoma lepi bambu wangu, muni mwene ahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kuyitaliwa mahuta avya nkosi.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Lola, dadi wangu, lingulila lugwinyilu lwa nyula yaku ulu mu mawoko gangu. Nadumwili lugwinyilu lwa kanzu yaku nambu nakukomili lepi. Hinu uhotola kumanya kuvya chakaka nene nikubudili lepi amala kukung'anamukila. Nene nikubudili lepi nambu veve ukunilonda muni unikoma. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Bambu Chapanga ndi atihamula lelu nene na veve, na mwene akuwuyisila gahakahu goha geunikitili nambu nene yati nikukitila lepi gahakahu. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kumbukayi luhumu lwa vandu va kadeni, hijova naha ‘Kwa vandu vahakahu vikita gahakahu,’ Nambu nene yati nikukitila lepi gahakahu. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Hinu veve wankosi wa Isilaeli, ndi yani mweugana kumkamula? Ndi yani mweukumlandalila? Ndi libwa lelifwili! Ndi lumbapani! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Bambu Chapanga ndi avyayi muhamula witu pagati ya nene na veve. Mwene auwona uhakau weukunikitila na aniyunga.” <verse eid="1SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi peamalili kujova genago, Sauli akamkota Daudi, “Wu, lwenulu ndi lwami lwaku wamwana wangu Daudi?” Sauli akavemba kwa lwami luvaha. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Kangi akamujovela Daudi, “Veve ndi wamundu mweukita gegiganikiwa na Chapanga kuliku nene, unikitili gabwina nambu nene nikukitili gahakahu! <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Lelu unilangisi chila cheuvi mbwina kwa nene. Wanikomili lepi pamonga kuvya Bambu Chapanga akuhotwisi unikoma. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Wu, mundu akamukamulayi likoko waki ndi ihotola kumuleka ahambayi yegwa? Ndava ya lila leunikitili lelu, Bambu Chapanga akuwuyasila gabwina! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Hinu nimanyi kuvya veve yati uvya nkosi wa Isilaeli, na yati ukuukita unkosi wa Isilaeli uvya ngangali. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Hinu unilapila kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga kuvya yati ukuchikoma lepi chiveleku changu, na yati ukita lepi liina langu likoto kukumbukwa pagati ya vandu va lukolo lwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi akalapa kugatimilisa gala geayupili Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">Kangi Sauli akawuya ku nyumba yaki, na mwene Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vakawuya kuhamba pandu pevajihihayi.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Samweli ifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samweli akafwa, penapo Vaisilaeli voha vakakonganeka ndava ya kumkitila malilo Samweli. Vakamzika ku nyumba yaki ku Lama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Abigaili akumyupa Daudi akoto kumkoma Nabali</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Kangi Daudi akahamba ku lugangatu lwa ku Palani. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Kwavili na mundu mmonga ku muji wa Maoni mweavili na vindu vyamahele uko ku Kalimeli, mundu mwenuyo avii na vindu vyamahele neju. Avii na mene elufu yimonga na mambelele elufu zidatu geagadumula mangoma uko ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mundu mwenuyo akemiwi Nabali, na mdala waki akemiwi Abigaili. Abigaili avii mdala mweavi na luhala na mweanyambili neju, nambu Nabali mngana waki, mweavili wa lukolo lwa Kalebu, avii mundu muhakau na mweinyimana. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Daudi peavili ku lukongolo ayuwini kuvya Nabali agadumulayi mambelele gaki mangoma ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Ndi Daudi akavatuma vasongolo kumi akavajovela, “Muhambayi mukanijambusila Nabali uko ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Yati mukumjovela Daudi akujambusa ijova, ‘Utama wumi wa magono gamahele na gegavi gabwina, veve na vandu va mu nyumba yaku pamonga na vyoha vyeuvii navyu. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Niyuwini kuvya lukumbi ulu ndi lweukugadumula mambelele gaku mangoma, Vadimaji vaku pevatama na tete tavakitili lepi gahakahu. Na vayiviwi lepi chindu chavi chochoha pevavili na tete kuni ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Vakotayi vadimaji vaku na vene yati vakukujovela. Hinu nikuyupa uvakitilayi lipyana vasongolo vangu, muni tibwelili lukumbi lwa mselebuko. Chondi nikukuyupa uvapela vahengaji vaku na mwana waku Daudi chochoha cheuvii nachu.’” <verse eid="1SA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Vasongolo vala va Daudi vakahamba na kumujovela Nabali ngati chevalagiswi na Daudi. Kangi vakalindila chidogo. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali akavayangula vasongolo va Daudi, “Mwenuyu Daudi ndi yani? Mwenuyu mwana wa Yese ndi yani? Magono aga kuvii na vatumisi vamahele neju vevakuvatila vabambu vavi. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Wu, nitolayi mabumunda gangu na manji gangu na nyofu zenivatendekili vandu vevidumula mangoma ga mambelele gangu, na kuvapela vandu hati venangavamanya vahumili kwoki!”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ndi vasongolo vala vakawuya kumujovela Daudi gevayanguliwi. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Penapo Daudi akavajovela vandu vaki, “Mwavoha mujikungayi mapanga ginu mu hiwunu.” Ndi kila mmonga akajikunga lipanga laki, na mwene Daudi mewa akajikunga upanga waki. Vandu miya mcheche vakamulanda Daudi, na vandu miya hivili ndi vakasigalila kuyangali vindu. <verse eid="1SA 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Msongolo mmonga wa Nabali, akamujovela Abigaili mdala wa Nabali, “Daudi avatumili vajumbi kuhuma ku lukongolo kubwela kumujambusa mkulu witu, nambu mwene avaligili. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Nambu vandu venava vatihengili mambu gabwina neju, vatikitili lepi gahakahu, na lukumbi lwoha lwetavili navu kudasi tayagisi lepi chindu chitu chochoha. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Vandu venava vavili ngati manjolinjoli va kutiyunga kilu na muhi, lukumbi lwoha lwetadimayi mifwiya papipi yavi. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Hinu uholalela lijambu lenili na umanya cha kukita. Chenichi chihotola kuleta msolo kwa bambu witu na kwa vandu vaki voha. Mngana waku Nabali ndi mundu muhakahu na kawaka mweihotola kulongela nayu!” <verse eid="1SA 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili akakita kanyata kutola mabumunda miya hivili na tuhaku tuvili twetumemi divayi na nyofu ya mambelele muhanu yeyibanikwi na hipimu kumi na saba ya mandulutulu na hikonyo miya yimonga ya zabibu ziyumu na mabumunda miya hivili ga tini vyoha akavikwesa panani ya lipunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Kangi akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Mulongolela na nene yati nikuvalanda.” Nambu amjovili lepi Nabali mgana waki.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Peahelelayi kuni akwelili lipunda laki, kuhuma ku chitumbi kuhamba ku likemba, chigafula akamuwona Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vihelela vibwela kula kweavii mwene. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi aholalili kuvya, “Nene nijing'ahili kuyunga vindu vya mundu mwenuyu ku lugangatu changali kupata chindu chochoha, na kawaka chindu chaki chochoha chechiyagili, nambu mwene aniwuyisila gahakahu kwa gala gabwina goha genamkitili. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Bambu Chapanga anibunayi neju nene ngati chilau yati nikuvakoma lepi vahengaji voha vagosi va mundu mwenuyu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili peamuweni Daudi, kanyata akahuluka pa lipunda laki na akagundama palongolo ya Daudi mbaka pamihu paki pakapamisa pahi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Akajigwisa pamagendelu ga Daudi na kumujovela, “Veve wa mkulu wangu, kubuda kwenuku ndi kuvyayi kwa nene. Chondi, niyidakilila nilongelayi na veve. Chondi, nikuyupa uyuwanilayi malovi genigana kukujovela mtumisi waku. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nikuyupa bambu wangu, ukotoka kumuholalela mundu muhakau Nabali. Mwene ndi mwehu ngati chelivili liina laki, na mwene ikita ngati mwehu. Bambu wangu, vasongolo vaku pewavatumili nene namtumisi waku navaweni lepi. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Hinu bambu wangu, nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, na veve cheuvii mumi, Bambu Chapanga akubesili ukotoka kuwuyisa mbunu kwa kukoma vandu wamwene, valeka vamakoko vaku na vala voha vevakuyupila gakukolela gahakahu vavya vahimu ngati Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Mkulu wangu nikuyupa upokelayi njombi vyenikuletili nene namtumisi waku na uvapelayi vatumisi vaku vevilandana na veve. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Chondi unilekekesayi nene namtumisi waku kubuda kwokwoha kwenikukitili. Nimanyili kuvya Bambu Chapanga yati akukukita veve uvya nkosi na uveleku waku mewa yati vivya vankosi, muni veve utovana ngondo za Bambu Chapanga. Uhakau ukoto kuvya mu wumi waku. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Kukavyayi na mundu mweakulandalila muni akukoma, Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, yati akuyunga ngati mundu chaiyunga chindu cha mashonga gamahele, nambu vamakoko Bambu Chapanga yati akuvataga kutali ngati mundu cheijugumila liganga kwa ngumbewa. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Bambu Chapanga peimala kukita mambu goha gabwina ngati cheakujovili, na kukuhagula veve uvya nkosi wa Isilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />veve mkulu wangu yati kuvya lepi na chindu cha kukukita uvya ngolongondi amala kuviniswa mu mtima ndava ya kukoma kwa kugana kuwuyasila mbunu. Bambu Chapanga peakukitilayi gabwina, nikuyupa kotoka kunikosiwa nene mtumisi waku.” <verse eid="1SA 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi akamuyangula Abigaili, “Atopeswa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, mweakutumili veve lelu ukonganekayi na nene. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Bambu Chapanga akumotisa ndava ya cheuhengili kwa luhala kunidivalila nene nikoto kuhamba kukoma na kuwuyisila gahakau kwa chiwoko changu. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Chakaka Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli anidivalili nikotoka kukukoma. Ngati ngaukotoka kubwela kanyata kukonganeka na nene, chilau lukela kawaka mundu mgosi yeyoha mweavi pagati ya vandu va Nabali mwengasigalili mumi wala Nabali mwene!” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Daudi akapokela njombi zoha zeamuletili Abigaili, na akamujovela Abigaili, “Kiliwukayi kunyumba yaku na ukoto kuyogopa. Nigayuwini malovi gaku na niyidakili cheuniyupili.” <verse eid="1SA 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili peakiliwiki ku nyumba, akamukolela Nabali ikita mselebuko weuvi na vandu vamahele ngati wa chinkosi. Nabali avili mweasangalwiki na agalili neju. Ndava yeniyo Abigaili amujovili lepi chindu chochoha mbaka lukela. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Lukela Abigaili peaweni mngana waki ugimbi umuwukili mu mutu na kuvya bwina, akamujovela mambu goha, bahopo Nabali akapola higa yikagogodala akavya ngati liganga. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Pegapitili magono kumi, Bambu Chapanga akamkoma Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi peayuwini kuvya Nabali afwili, akajova, “Atopeswa Bambu Chapanga mweamulipisi Nabali kwa kuniliga, Bambu Chapanga mweamukiti mtumisi waki akotoka kukoto kukita uhakau ngati wenuwo na Bambu Chapanga amuhamwili Nabali ndava ya uhakahu waki.” Penapo Daudi akavatuma vandu kwa Abigaili vakamuhonga avya mdala waki. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Vatumisi va Daudi vakahamba mbaka ku Kalimeli na kumujovela Abigaili naha, “Daudi atitumili tibwela kukutola uvya mdala waki.” <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili akayima peatamili na kugundama palongolo yavi mbaka pahi na kujova, “Nene namtumisi ndu, niyidakili kuvahengela na hati kuvasanja magendelu vahengaji va bambu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili akakita kanyata, akayinuka na kukwela pa lipunda laki, akalandana na vatumisi vaki va chidala muhanu, akalongosana na vavanda va Daudi, na mwene akavya mdala wa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Mewawa Daudi akamugega Ahinoamu wa ku Yezileeli, penapo voha vavili vakavya vadala vaki. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Lukumbi lwenulo Sauli amuwusili Mikali msikana waki mweavii mdala wa Daudi agegewayi na Paliti, mwana wa Laishi, mweihuma ku muji weukemiwa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akumleka kavili Sauli mumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Vagosi vangi kuhuma ku Zifu vakamuhambila Sauli ku Gibea na kumujovela kuvya, Daudi ajihihi ku chitumbi chechikemiwa Hakila, kuupandi welihumila lilanga wa muji Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ndi Sauli akahelela kuhamba ku lugangatu lwelukemiwa Zifu kumulonda Daudi kuni alongosini na manjolinjoli vakekesi elufu zidatu vevahaguliwi pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Na mwene Sauli akavika kambi pamuhana ya njila panani chidunda chechikemiwa Hakila, chechilolesana na muji wa ku Yeshimoni. Nambu Daudi avii akona kulugangatu, Daudi peamanyili kuvya Sauli abwelili kudasi kumulonda, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ndi akavatuma vamang'omesi na vene vakabwela kumujovela kuvya chakaka Sauli abwelili. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Ndi Daudi akawuka akahamba pandu peavikili Sauli kambi. Akapawona pandu pevagonili Sauli pamonga na Abuneli mwana wa Neli, mkekesi wa manjolinjoli ga Sauli. Sauli agonili pagati ya kambi kuni manjolinjoli gaki gamtindili pandi zoha. <verse eid="1SA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Penapo Daudi avakotili Ahimeleki mweavili wa likabila la Vahiti, na Abishai mulongo waki Yoabu, nyina wavi akemiwayi Seluya, “Yani yati ihamba pamonga na nene ku kambi ya Sauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishai akamuyangula, “Nene yati nihamba pamonga na veve.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Kilu Daudi na Abishai vakayingila mu kambi ya Sauli, vakamukolela Sauli agonili pagati ya lindanda lenilo, papipi na mutu waki ndi ahomiki mgoha waki pandima. Abuneli pamonga na manjolinjoli vangi vagonili kumutindila Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai akamjovela Daudi, “Lelu Bambu Chapanga akuhotwisi umkoma likoko waku mumawoko gaku. Hinu nileka nene nimuhome mala yimonga mbaka mgoha uhumila pahi, nene yati nikumuhoma lepi mala zivili!” <verse eid="1SA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Nambu Daudi akamjovela Abishai, “Kotoka kumukoma! Muni chakaka Bambu Chapanga yati akumbuna mundu yoyoha mweigolosayi chiwoko chaki kwa mundu waki mweamuhagwili kwa kumyitila mahuta.” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Daudi akajova, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, kuvya Bambu Chapanga mwene ndi mweakumukoma Sauli, na ligono laki la kufwa yati lihika ndu, amala yati ihamba ku ngondo na kufwilila kukwokwo. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Bambu Chapanga anidivalila nikotoka kuchigolosa chiwoko changu kukoma mundu waki mweamuhagwili kwa kumnyalili mahuta avya nkosi! Nambu tolayi mugoha waki weauhomiki papipi na mutu waki na libotolo laki la manji, kangi tiwukayi peapa.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ndi Daudi akatola mgoha wula na libotolo la manji vyevyavii papipi na mutu wa Sauli, kangi vakawuka penapo. Nambu kawaka mundu mwealolili amala kumanya chechahumalili, na kawaka mundu mweayimwiki, muni Bambu Chapanga avaletili lugono tipitipi. <verse eid="1SA 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Penapo Daudi akahamba ku upandi wungi wa ligema lenilo na kuyima ku chituvilu cha chitumbi patali neju na msambi wa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Kangi Daudi akaukemela msambi wa manjolinjoli ga Sauli pamonga na Abuneli mwana wa Neli kuni ijova, “Wu, Abuneli ukuniyuwana?” Abuneli akakota, “Wayani veve mweukumkemela nkosi?” <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi akamuyangula, “Veve wamgosi lepi mkekesi? Yani mweavii ngati veve pa Isilaeli? Hinu mbona wamuyungili lepi bambu waku nkosi? Mundu mmonga ayingili kwinu kumukoma bambu waku nkosi. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Abineli ichi cheukuchikita chabwina lepi. Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, veve na vandu vaku mganikiwa mfwayi, muni mwamuyungili lepi bambu winu mweayitiwi mahuta na Bambu Chapanga avya nkosi! Mlola penapo pemuvili, wu uvii kwoki mgoha wa nkosi na libotolo laki la manji vyevyavii papipi na mutu waki?” <verse eid="1SA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli akalumanya lwami lwa Daudi ndi akakota, “Wu, lwenulu ndi lwami lwaku wamwana wangu Daudi?” Daudi akayangula, “Ena, ulu ndi lwami lwangu bambu wangu nkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Kangi akayendelela kujova, “Ndava kyani bambu wangu ukunilonda londa? Nikitili kyani? Na nikuhokili kyani? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Hinu wabambu wangu nkosi, yuwanilayi malovi ga muhengaji waku. Yikavyayi Bambu Chapanga ndi mweakung'anamwisi uvya walikoko wangu, hinu apokelayi luteta lwa kutinyiswa lwelukumkita ang'anamusa mpangu waki. Nambu ngati vandu ndi vevakitili chenicho, vandu venavo vapewa likoto palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, muni vanivingili niwuka pa mulima weatipelili Bambu Chapanga na vakajova kuvya, ‘Hamba ukaifugamila michapanga hingi.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Kotoka kunileka nifwilila ku mulima wa chiyehe, kutali na peavii Bambu Chapanga. Ndava kyani veve nkosi wa Isilaeli ubwelili kunilonda nene mwenivii ngati lumbapani? Ndava kyani ukunilonda nene ngati mundu mweilonda ngwali kuhitumbi?” <verse eid="1SA 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Sauli akamuyangula, “Nikitili uhakahu, wuyayi wamwana wangu Daudi! Yati niwuyila lepi kavili kulinga kukukoma, muni lelu unilekili kavili mumi. Nene namuyimu na nibudili neju!” <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi akayangula, “Veve nkosi, mgoha waku uvii kuni, mtumayi linjolinjoli waku mmonga abwela kuutola. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Bambu Chapanga akumpela njombi kila mundu msadikika mweikita geigana Bambu. Lelu Bambu Chapanga anihotwisi nikukoma, nambu nene nachigolwisi lepi chiwoko changu kukukoma, muni veve uhaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kunyalwa mahuta uvya nkosi. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Lola ngati chenikaweni kuvya wumi waku lelu uvii wabwina, chichocho wumi wangu uvii na ubwina kwa Bambu Chapanga, na mwene anisangwili niwuka mu mang'aiso gangu goha.” <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Penapo Sauli akamujovela Daudi, “Chapanga akumotisa wamwana wangu Daudi! Yati uhenga mambu gavaha na goha yati ukugahotola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Kangi Daudi akawuka akahamba na mwene Sauli akawuya ku nyumba yaki.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi itama na Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Daudi akaholalela mu mtima waki, “Ligono limonga Sauli yati akunikoma. Chabwina neju kutilalila ku mulima wa Vafilisiti. Penapo ndi Sauli yati ileka kunilonda mu mibaka ya pa Isilaeli, na nene yati nivya yegwa.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Penapo Daudi akawuka pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki miya sita, vakahamba ku Gati kwa nkosi Akishi mweavi mwana wa Maoki. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vakatama na nkosi Akishi ku Gati. Kila mundu atamili na vandu va mnyumba yaki, Daudi avili na vadala vavili, Ahinoamu kuhuma ku Yezileeli na Abigaili lipwela mweavii mdala wa Nabali kuhuma kumuji wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli peayuwini kuvya Daudi atilalili ku Gati, amulondili lepi kavili. <verse eid="1SA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Ligono limonga Daudi akamujovela Akishi, “Ngati yikukuganisa nene nivya pa mulima waku, nikuyupa unipelayi muji umonga mu muji waku pavya pandu pangu pa kutama. Chabwina lepi nene mtumisi waku kutama apa na veve pa muji uwu wa chinkosi.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ligono lenilo Akishi akampela Daudi muji wa Sikilagi. Kuhumila ligono lenilo muji wa Sikilagi ukavya wa vankosi va ku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi atamili pa mulima wa Vafilisiti kwa lukumbi lwa mwaka umonga na miyehi mcheche. <verse eid="1SA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Hinu Daudi na vandu vaki vakahamba na kuvazangila Vageshuli na Vagilizi na Vaamaleki. Kuhumila kadeni vandu venavo vavii vakolonjinji va milima yeniyo. Pandu pavi padandasiki kutumbula ku Telemu mu njila yeyihelela ku Shuli mbaka kuhika ku mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daudi akavakoma vandu voha va mulima wenuwo changali kumuleka hati mundu mmonga, akomi voha vadala na vagosi, atolili mambelele na ng'ombi na punda na ngamiya na nyula, kangi akawuya kwa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishi kila peamukotili Daudi, “Wu, lelu uzangili kwoki?” Daudi amuyangulayi, nizangili muji wa ku Negebu ya Yuda amala nizangili kumuji wa ku Negebu ya Vayelameeli amala nizangili kumuji wa ku Negebu ya ku Vakeni. <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi avakomili vandu voha, amulekili lepi mumi mundu yeyoha, avya mgosi amala mdala, muni pakoto kuvya na mundu wa kubwela ku Gati. Aholalili kuvya, “Vihotola kukokosa mambu genikitili nene.” Lwenulu lwavii luhumu lwaki lukumbi lwoha lweatamili ku mlima wa Vafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Ndava yeniyo Akishi akamsadika neju Daudi na kuholalela mu mtima waki kuvya, “Vaisilaeli vayaki vakumvenga neju Daudi, ndava yeniyo yati ivya mtumisi wangu magono goha gangali ni mwishu.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Pegapitili magono gadebe Vafilisiti vakakonganesa manjolinjoli gavi pamonga ndava ya kuhamba kutovana na Vaisilaeli. Akishi akamujovela Daudi, “Chakaka umanyayi kuvya veve pamonga na vandu vaku muganikiwa muhamba pamonga na tete ku ngondo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi akamuyangula Akishi, “Ena, yati ukunilola namuhengaji waku chenimanyi kutovana.” Akishi akayangula, “Na nene yati nikukukita veve uvya wamulonda wangu lukumbi lwoha lwa wumi wangu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli iyupa utangatila kwa mdala mlondola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Lukumbi lwenulo Samweli avii amali kufwa, na Vaisilaeli vavii vamali kumuvembenekela na kumuzika ku muji waki ku Lama. Sauli avii amali kuvavinga pa mulima vahavi na valondola.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Vafilisiti vakakonganeka na kuhamba kuvika kambi yavi ku Shunemu. Na mwene Sauli akavakonganesa Vaisilaeli voha na kuvika kambi yavi ku chitumbi Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli peavaweni manjolinjoli va Vaifilisiti, akayogopa na kuvya na wogohi neju. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Sauli akamkota Bambu Chapanga, nambu Bambu Chapanga amuyangwili lepi kwa kulota wala kwa maganga gavili gegikemiwa Ulimu na Tumimu hati kwa njila ya vamulota. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Penapo Sauli akavajovela vahengaji vaki, “Munilondelayi mdala mweihotola kulongela na mpungu wa vandu vevafwili ndava yangu, muni nihamba nikamkota.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Vahengaji vaki vakamuyangula, “Avili mlondola mmonga ku Endoli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ndi Sauli akajing'anamusa kwa kuwala nyula zingi muni akoto kumanyikana, akahamba kwenukwo pamonga na vandu vaki vavili. Vakahika kilu kwa mdala mwenuyo, ndi akamujovela, “Nilondolelayi kwa kuhengela mizuka na unijovela chechikunihumila, na umuletayi mundu mwenikumgana.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mudala yula akamujovela, “Veve umanyili njwe cheakitili nkosi Sauli, avavingili valondola voha va Isilaeli. Na veve ubwelili kunikamula ndava unikomayi?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli akalapa kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, kuvya yati ubuniwa lepi ndava ya lijambu lenili.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Mdala yula akamukota, “Wu, nikukemelela yani kuhuma kwa vevafwili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Sauli akayangula, “Nikemelela Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mdala yula peamuweni Samweli, akakenyemuka na kuvemba kwa lwami luvaha neju, na kumujovela Sauli, “Ndava kyani unikongili? Veve ndi Sauli!” <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Nkosi Sauli akamujovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa ulola kyani?” Mdala yula akayangula, “Niwona mchapanga uhumila pandima ukwela kunani.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli akamkota kavili mdala mwenuyo, “Mchapanga wenuwo uwonekana wuli?” Mdala yula akamuyangula. “Nikumuwona mgosi mgogolo ikwela kunani, awalili kanzu.” Penapo Sauli akamanya kuvya mwenuyo ndi Samweli, Sauli akamgundamila mdala mwenuyo mbaka pahi kwa utopesa.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli akamujovela Sauli, “Ndava kyani uning'ahili kwa kunileta kunani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli akayangula, “Nene nivii mu mang'aisu gavaha! Vafilisiti vikomana na nene, na Bambu Chapanga anilekili, akuniyangula lepi kwa njozi hati kwa njila ya vamulota. Ndi mana nikukemili muni unijovela nikita kyani.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli akamjovela, “Ndava kyani ukunikota nene cha kukita, kuni Bambu Chapanga akulekili, na kuvya likoko waku? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Bambu Chapanga akukitili chila cheakujovili kwa njila ya nene, Bambu Chapanga akunyagili unkosi waku na kumpela myaku Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Ndava veve wamuyidakili lepi Bambu Chapanga, wala watimilisi lepi ligoga laki kwa kuvakoma Vaamaleki ngati cheakulagizi. Ndava yeniyo lelu Bambu Chapanga akukitili mambu aga. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Bambu Chapanga yati akukita veve pamonga na Vaisilaeli voha mutalaliwa na Vafilisiti. Chilau veve pamonga na vana vaku yati muvya apa na nene. Mewawa Bambu Chapanga yati akuvakita manjolinjoli voha va Isilaeli vatoviwa na Vafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Bahopo Sauli akagwa pahi kuni iyogopa ndava ya malovi ga Samweli. Makakala gammaliki muni alili lepi ligono lenilo muhi na kilu. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Penapo mdala yula akamuhegelela Sauli, na peamuweni Sauli avii na wogohi neju, akamujovela, “Nene namuhengaji waku nikuyidakili veve. Nayidakili kufwa kwa kukita chila chewaganili nikita. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Chondi niyuwanila nene namuhengaji waku. Nileka nikupela chakulya chidogo ulyayi na veve yati upata makakala ga kuyendelela na lugendu lwa kuwuya kweuhumili.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Nambu sauli akabela na kumjovela, “Nene yati nilya lepi chakulya.” Nambu vahengaji vaki na mdala yula vakamuyupa alyayi, na mwene akavayidakila kulya. Penapo akayinuka na kutama pa chitanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mdala yula avii na mpapakasi wa ng'ombi umonga weukulupalili, akahinja kanyata na akateleka nyofu yaki, akatola uhembe wa nganu akaukanda na akateleka libumunda langali ngemeku. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Akamupela Sauli pamonga na vahengaji vaki na vene vakalya. Kangi vakayinuka vakawuka kilu yiyoyo.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Vafilisiti vibela kuhamba na Daudi ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Vafilisiti vakakonganesa manjolinjoli gavi goha ku Afeka, na Vaisilaeli vakavika kambi yavi pa chinyepa chechivii ku ligema la Yezileeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Vakulu muhanu va Vafilisiti pevapitayi na misambi yavi ya manjolinjoli mamiya na maelufu, Daudi na vandu vaki vagendayi mumbele yavi pamonga na nkosi Akishi na manjolinjoli vaki. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Vakekesi va Vafilisiti vakamkota Akishi, “Vaebulania venava vikita kyani peapa?” Akishi akavayangula vakekesi va Vafilisiti venavo, “Uyu ndi Daudi, mweavii muhengaji wa Sauli, nkosi wa ku Isilaeli. Mwenuyu avii na nene kwa mwaka umonga. Na tangiya peamulekili Sauli, niwaili lepi kulola muhalu wowoha kwaki mbaka lelu iyi.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Nambu manjolinjoli vakekesi va Vafilisiti vakamuyomela neju Akishi, vakamujovela, “Muwuyisa mundu mwenuyu akatama pandu peumupelili atamayi. Katu akotoka kuhamba pamonga na tete ku ngondo, ngati tikahamba nayu ihotola kuting'anamukila na kutitova ku ngondo. Wu, mlola lepi mundu mwenuyu yati ikoma vandu vitu na kwa njila yeniyo yati ipatana na bambu waki Sauli? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Wu, mwenuyu si ndi Daudi yulayula mwevayimbayi vadala lunyimbu kumuvala mwene kuni vikina, ‘Sauli akomili vandu maelufu nambu Daudi akomili vandu makumi elufu.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Hinu Akishi akamukemela Daudi na kumujovela, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi, kuvya veve wamundu msadikika kwa nene. Ngayivii chabwina neju kuvya uhamba pamonga na nene ku ngondo, ndava muni nilolili lepi chindu chihakahu kwaku tangiya ligono lila lewabwelili kwa nene mbaka lelu. Nambu vakulu vakusadika lepi veve. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Hinu wuya ku nyumba, ukatama kwa uteke, na ukotoka kukita chindu chochoha cha kuvayomesa vakulu va Vafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Nambu Daudi akamkota Akishi, “Nambu nene nikitili kyani? Ngati cheujova kuvya uchiweni lepi chenibudili tangiya ligono lila lenatumbwili kukuhengela mbaka lelu, ndava kyani nikotoka kuhamba kutovana na vamakoko va mkulu wangu nkosi?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi akamujovela, “Nimanyili kuvya veve usadikika ngati mtumu wa Chapanga. Nambu vamanjolinjoli vakekesi va Vafilisiti vajovili, katu akotoka kuhamba na tete kungondo. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Hinu veve na Vaisilaeli vayaku vevabwelili pamonga na veve, chilau pekwicha muwukayi.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ndi chilau yaki lukela, Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vakawuka na kukiliwuka ku mulima wa Vafilisiti. Na vene Vafilisiti vahambili ku Yezileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi itovana na Vaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Pegapitili magono gadatu, Daudi pamonga na vandu vaki vakakiliwuka ku Sikilagi. Vaamaleki vavii vamali kuutova mulima wa kusini ya Yuda weukemiwa Negebu pamonga na muji wa Sikilagi na kuutinyisa motu. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Vavakamwili vadala na vandu voha vevavili mu muji wenuwo, vavaha na vadebe. Vamkomili lepi hati mmonga, nambu vavatolili na kuhamba navu. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na vandu vaki pevahikili mu muji weukemiwa Sikilagi, vakakolela muji utinyiswi na motu, vadala pamonga na vana vavi vagosi na vadala vakamuliwi na kutolewa. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Penapo Daudi na vandu vaki vakatumbula kuvemba kwa lwami mbaka makakala gakavamalika. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Vadala vavili va Daudi, Ahinoamu wa kuhuma ku Yezileeli na Abigaili lipwela mweavii mdala wa Nabali wa kuhuma ku Kalimeli, na vena mewa vatoliwi.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Penapo Daudi avii mu mang'aisu gavaha muni vandu vajovesanayi kugana kumutova maganga, kila mundu avii na mvinisu mu mtima waki ndava ya kuyagisa vana vavi vagosi na vadala. Nambu Daudi apewi makakala na Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waki. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Penapo Daudi akamujovela mteta Abiasali mwana wa Ahimeleki, “Niletela kakoti ka chimteta.” Abiatali akamupelekela. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daudi akamukota Bambu Chapanga, “Wu, niulandayi msambi uwu wa manjolinjoli vevavatoli vandu vitu? Yati nikuvakamula?” Bambu Chapanga akamuyangula, “Uvalandayi muni yati ukuvakamula na kuvasangula vandu vevatoliwi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Penapo ndi Daudi akawuka pamonga na manjolinjoli miya sita veavili navu. Pevahikili pa kapela kekikemiwa Besoli, vakavakolela vandu vavi vangi vavalekili penapo. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Nambu Daudi akayendelela kugalandalila manjolinjoli gala kuni avii na manjolinjoli vaki miya mcheche na vangi miya hivili avalekili pa kapela kenako pamonga na vevavakolili vala muni vatotokili vahotwili lepi kuyomboka kapela kenako. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Pevahambayi vakamkolela Mmisili mmonga pa mgunda, na vene vakamupeleka kwa Daudi, vakamupela Mmisili mwenuyo manji ga kunywa na chakulya. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Mewawa vakamupela kangi chipandi cha libumunda la tini na hipanyu hivili ya zabibu hiyumu. Peamalili kulya, akavya na makakala, muni mundu mwenuyo alili lepi chindu chochoha kwa magono gadatu muhi na kilu. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi akamukota, “Mkulu waku ndi yani? Na uhumalili kwoki?” Mwene akamujovela, “Nene nihumalili ku Misili, namvanda wa Muamaleki. Mkulu wangu anilekili mumbele mu magono gadatu gegapitili muni nene nalwalayi. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Tete tahambili kutovana ngondo ku Negebu yaani kusini mwa mulima wa Yuda Kalebu. Na tete tiyochili motu muji wa Sikilagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi akamukota, “Wu, uhotola kunipeleku mbaka kweuvii msambi wenuwo wa vandu vevavatolili vandu vitu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Msongolo mwenuyo akamuyangula, “Ngati ukanilapilayi kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga kuvya yati ukunikoma lepi, wala kunipeleka kwa mkulu wangu, ndi yati nikukupeleka.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Msongolo yula akamulongosa Daudi mbaka peuvili msambi wula. Pevahikili penapo vavakolili vamali kudandasika kila pandu, valyayi na kunywega na kuhina ndava vindu vyevanyajili kuhuma ku mlima wa Vafilisiti na ku mlima wa Yuda vyavili vyamahele neju. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi akavatova tangia lukela mbaka ligono lelalandili chimihi. Kawaka mugosi mweasigalili mumi nga vala ndu miya mcheche vevakwelili ngamiya na kutila. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi awuyisi kila chindu chechanyagiwi na Vaamaleki, pamonga na vadala vaki vavili. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Daudi awuyisi vindu vyoha, kawaka chechahovalili vakavya vasongolo amala vagogolo mwana mgosi amala wa chidala, na vindu vyoha vyevanyagili Vaamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Mewa Daudi asangwili na misambi yoha ya ng'ombi na mambelele, na vandu vevahilongosayi vakaulongosa msambi wa mifuya palongolo ya mifuya ya Daudi na vijova, “Vyenivi ndi vindu vyeanyagili Daudi!”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Daudi avawuyili vandu vala miya zivili veavalekili pa kapela ka Besoli ndava muni vatotokili kumulanda. Vandu vala pevamuweni Daudi pamonga na vandu vealongosini navu, vakahamba kumpokela. Daudi peahegalili papipi na vandu venavo, akavajambusa. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Nambu vandu voha vahakahu na vevanaluhonda vevavili pagati ya vandu vevalandini na Daudi, vakajova, “Tigavana lepi na vandu ava chindu chochoha chetinyagili muni vahambili lepi pamonga na tete. Nambu vihotola kuvatola vadala vavi na vana vavi ndu vahamba.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi akavayangula, “Naha lepi mwavalongo vangu. Chabwina lepi kukita chenichi muvindu vyetipewi na Bambu Chapanga. Bambu Chapanga atiyungili bwina, na atikitili tivahotola msambi wula wevabwelili kutizangila. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Kawaka mundu mweakugayidakilayi aga gemwijova! Mweahambili kungondo na mweasigalili kuyunga vindu voha yati vipewa cha kuwanangana.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Tangia ligono lenilo Daudi akavika muhilu wenuwo pa mulima wa Isilaeli mbaka lelu.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi peawuyili ku Sikilagi, akavapelekela vagogo va mlima wa Yuda vevavii vankozi vaki pandu pa vindu vyeanyagili na kujova, “Zenizi ndi njombi zinu kuhuma mu vindu vyetitolili kuhuma kwa vamakoko va Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Akavapelekela vevavili ku muji wa Beteli na muji wa Lamoti na ku muji wa kusini yaani Negebu na vevavii ku muji wa Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na vala vevitama ku muji wa Aloeli na muji wa Sifimoti na vevitama ku muji wa Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na vevitama ku muji wa Lakali na vevitama ku muji wa Vayelameeli na vevitama ku muji wa Vakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na vala vevitama ku muji wa Holima na vevitama ku muji wa Bolashani na vevitama ku muji wa Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na vala vevitama ku muji wa Hebuloni. Mewawa Daudi avapelakili njombi vagogo vevavii vankozi vaki vevitama ku milima yoha yeayigendalili mwene na vandu vaki.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Sauli na vana vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Lus 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Vafilisiti vakatovana ngondo na Vaisilaeli, na Vaisilaeli vakavatila Vafilisiti na vandu vamahele vakomiwi kwenuko ku chitumbi Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Vafilisiti vakavazangila Sauli na vana vaki, na vakavakoma Yonatani na Abinadabu na Malikishua vana vaki Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ngondo yavili yivaha neju kumuhambila Sauli, vevijugumila nduta vamjugumili Sauli nduta zenizo na vamulemisi neju. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Penapo Sauli akamujovela mundu mweakumugegela vindu vya ngondo, “Holomolayi upanga waku unikomayi, na ngati wangakita chenicho vandu venava vangadumuliwa jandu yati vakunihoma upanga na kunivevesa.” Nambu mundu mwenuyo abelili muni ayogwipi neju. Ndava yeniyo Sauli akautola upanga waki mwene na akaugwilila. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Mweigega vindu vya ngondo yula peaweni Sauli afwili, na mwene akagwilila upanga waki, na akafwa. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Penapo Sauli pamonga na vana vaki vadatu na mundu mweagega vindu vya ngondo vya Sauli na vandu vaki voha vawili ligono lenilo limonga. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Vaisilaeli vevavili upandi wungi wa ligema na vala vevavili ku mwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani pevaweni kuvya Vaisilaeli vatilili na Sauli na vana vaki vafwili, vakatila na kuhileka miji yavi. Vafilisiti vakahamba kutama mu miji yeniyo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Ligono lelalandili Vafilisiti pevahambili kutola vindu vya vandu vala vevakomiwi, vayiwene higa ya Sauli na vana vaki vadatu vafwili ku chitumbi Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Vakamudumula Sauli mutu na kumuhula vindu vyaki vya ngondo, na vakatuma vajumbi vahamba ku mulima wa Vafilisiti kukokosa kufwa kwa Sauli mu nyumba za michapanga yavi na kwa vandu vavi. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Vindu vyaki vya ngondo vakavivika mu nyumba ya kumfugamila mchapanga wavi Ashitaloti, vakayitola higa yaki na kuyiyinjisa mu luwumba lwa muji wa Beti Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Vandu va muji wa Yabeshi Gileadi pevayuwini Vafilisiti chevamukitili Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />vakekesi vavi voha vakahamba lugendu lwa kilu yoha, vakayihulusa higa ya Sauli pa luwumba lwa Beti Shani pamonga na higa za vana vaki. Vakahamba nayu mbaka ku Yabeshi na kuhitinyisa kwa motu. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Kangi vakagatola majege gavi na kugazika pahi ya chikongo chechikemiwa Mkwaju ku Yabeshi, na vene vakajihinisa changali kulya mu magono saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>